顯示地址」）即可找到。','Optional, more precise than the address.'=>'可選，比地址更精確。','Longitude'=>'經度','Map type'=>'地圖類型','Satellite'=>'衛星','Google Maps API key (optional)'=>'Google Maps API 金鑰（可選）','The map works without a key. With a key of the Maps Embed API (free in the Google Cloud console) it uses the official embed.'=>'地圖無需金鑰即可使用。使用 Maps Embed API 的金鑰（在 Google Cloud 控制台中免費獲取）時，將使用官方嵌入方式。','Height'=>'高度','In pixels'=>'以像素為單位','Part of the screen height'=>'螢幕高度的比例','Height (% of the screen)'=>'高度（螢幕的 %）','Height (px)'=>'高度（px）','Black and white map'=>'黑白地圖','Visitors can move and zoom the map'=>'訪客可以移動和縮放地圖','Off: the map is only a picture in the background.'=>'關閉：地圖僅作為背景圖片。','Content on the map'=>'地圖上的內容','In a card'=>'在卡片中','Horizontal position'=>'水平位置','Vertical position'=>'垂直位置','Top'=>'頂部','Middle'=>'中間','Bottom'=>'底部','Width (px)'=>'寬度（px）','Under the map on phones'=>'手機上顯示在地圖下方','Privacy'=>'隱私','Load the map only after a click'=>'僅在點選後載入地圖','The map service (and its cookies) loads only when the visitor clicks the button; the choice is remembered in the browser.'=>'地圖服務（及其 Cookie）僅在訪客點選按鈕後載入；該選擇會紀錄在瀏覽器中。','Show the map'=>'顯示地圖','Text above the button'=>'按鈕上方的文字','The map is loaded from OpenStreetMap.'=>'地圖從 OpenStreetMap 載入。','The map is loaded from Google Maps, which may store cookies.'=>'地圖從 Google Maps 載入，可能會存儲 Cookie。','Color over the map'=>'地圖上的顏色','Enter the latitude and longitude of the place in the block settings.'=>'請在區塊設定中輸入該地點的緯度和經度。','Enter the address (or the coordinates) of the place in the block settings.'=>'請在區塊設定中輸入該地點的地址（或坐標）。','Add message'=>'新增消息','Behaviour'=>'行為','Show the messages'=>'顯示消息','One at a time, taking turns'=>'一次一條，輪流顯示','Scrolling ticker (marquee)'=>'捲動字幕（跑馬燈）','All side by side'=>'全部並排','Nothing moves for visitors who turned on "reduce motion", and the bar stops while the pointer or the keyboard is in it.'=>'對於開啟「減少動態效果」的訪客，內容不會移動；當滑鼠指針或鍵盤焦點在欄中時，欄會停止。','Seconds per message'=>'每條消息的秒數','Show arrows'=>'顯示箭頭','Speed (pixels per second)'=>'速度（每秒像素）','Visitors can close the bar'=>'訪客可以關閉此欄','Keep it closed for (days)'=>'保持關閉（天）','0 = until the browser tab is closed. Changing the messages shows the bar again.'=>'0 = 直到關閉瀏覽器標籤頁。更改消息後會再次顯示此欄。','Counts down to'=>'倒計時至','End'=>'結束','A date and time'=>'日期和時間','A time every day'=>'每天的某個時間','Ends at'=>'結束於','In the time zone of the site (Settings > General). Every visitor sees the same end.'=>'使用網站的時區（設定 > 常規）。每位訪客看到的結束時間相同。','Every day at'=>'每天於','For example the cut-off time for same-day shipping. In the time zone of the site.'=>'例如當日發貨的截止時間。使用網站的時區。','On these days'=>'在這些日子','After the time and on other days'=>'該時間之後及其他日子','Count down to the next chosen day'=>'倒計時到下一個所選日子','Hide until the next chosen day'=>'隱藏到下一個所選日子','When it ends'=>'結束時','Hide the block'=>'隱藏區塊','Show a text'=>'顯示文字','Text when it ends'=>'結束時的文字','This offer has ended.'=>'此優惠已結束。','Text above (optional)'=>'上方文字（可選）','Sale ends in'=>'促銷結束倒計時','Numbers in boxes'=>'方框中的數字','Plain numbers'=>'純數字','Show days'=>'顯示天數','Off: the hours go above 24.'=>'關閉：小時數會超過 24。','Show seconds'=>'顯示秒數','Show labels'=>'顯示標籤','Numbers'=>'數字','Boxes'=>'方框','Labels'=>'標籤','Week'=>'週','For example 9:00-17:00, or 9:00-12:00, 13:00-18:00 with a lunch break. Leave empty for closed. A time after midnight (18:00-2:00) belongs to the day it starts.'=>'例如 9:00-17:00，或含午休的 9:00-12:00, 13:00-18:00。留空表示休息。跨午夜的時間（18:00-2:00）屬於開始的那一天。','Closed'=>'休息','Special days'=>'特殊日子','Holidays and other days'=>'節假日和其他日子','One per line: 2026-12-24 = 9:00-12:00 | Christmas Eve, or 12-25 = (closed every year). The note after | is optional.'=>'每行一個：2026-12-24 = 9:00-12:00 | 平安夜，或 12-25 =（每年休息）。| 後面的備注為可選。','List the special days of the next 30 days'=>'列出未來 30 天內的特殊日子','Opening hours'=>'營業時間','Show "Open now / Closed"'=>'顯示「營業中 / 已打烊」','Worked out in the visitor\'s browser in the time zone of the site, so it is right on cached pages too.'=>'在訪客瀏覽器中按網站時區計算，因此在快取頁面上也是正確的。','Show the week'=>'顯示一週','Highlight today'=>'突出顯示今天','Join days with the same hours'=>'合並營業時間相同的日子','Monday – Friday instead of five rows.'=>'顯示「週一 – 週五」，而不是五行。','Text for closed days'=>'休息日的文字','Box with a border'=>'帶邊框的框','Open'=>'營業中','Today'=>'今天','Stock'=>'庫存','Stock of'=>'庫存對象','Only the real stock is shown: the product (or variation) needs "Manage stock?" turned on in WooCommerce.'=>'僅顯示真實庫存：產品（或變體）需要在 WooCommerce 中開啟「管理庫存？」。','Show "Only … left" at this stock or less'=>'庫存不高於此數時顯示「僅剩 …」','The bar is full at'=>'庫存達到此數時條形為滿','Stock at or above this number fills the bar.'=>'庫存達到或高於此數時條形填滿。','Show "In stock" above that number'=>'高於該數時顯示「有貨」','Show "Out of stock" and backorders'=>'顯示「缺貨」和預訂','Leave empty for the default text. {stock} is the number in stock.'=>'留空則使用預設文字。{stock} 為庫存數量。','Low stock'=>'庫存不足','Only {stock} left in stock'=>'僅剩 {stock} 件','In stock'=>'有貨','Out of stock'=>'缺貨','On backorder'=>'可預訂','Available on backorder'=>'可預訂','Show the bar'=>'顯示條形','Show the colored dot'=>'顯示彩色圓點','Bar'=>'條形','Bar background'=>'條形背景','Lowest price'=>'最低價格','Price of'=>'價格：','The lowest price comes from the price history that Envo Blocks keeps for every product. Defaults: Envo Blocks > Lowest Price.'=>'最低價格來自 Envo Blocks 為每個產品儲存的價格歷史。預設值：Envo Blocks > 最低價格。','Number of days (0 = the setting)'=>'天數（0 = 使用設定）','The EU rule is 30 days.'=>'歐盟規定為 30 天。','Show it'=>'顯示','As in the setting'=>'與設定相同','Only for products on sale'=>'僅限促銷產品','For every product'=>'所有產品','{days} is the number of days, {price} the lowest price. Leave empty for the text of the setting.'=>'{days} 為天數，{price} 為最低價格。留空則使用設定中的文字。','Lowest price in the last {days} days: {price}'=>'最近 {days} 天最低價格：{price}','With a background'=>'帶背景','Attribute (color, size …)'=>'屬性（顏色、尺碼 …）','Category'=>'分類','Stock status'=>'庫存狀態','On sale'=>'促銷','Brand'=>'品牌','Check boxes'=>'核取方塊','Links'=>'連結','Buttons'=>'按鈕','Dropdown'=>'下拉清單','Swatches (colors, images)'=>'色板（顏色、圖片）','Filter'=>'篩選','Filters the products of the shop, the categories and the product search (classic shop or the Product Collection block). On other pages the options link to the shop.'=>'篩選商店、分類和產品搜尋中的產品（經典商店或 Product Collection 區塊）。在其他頁面上，選項會連結到商店。','Filter by'=>'篩選依據','Attribute'=>'屬性','The first attribute'=>'第一個屬性','More values'=>'多個值','Products with any of them'=>'包含任一項的產品','Products with all of them'=>'包含全部的產品','Levels of subcategories'=>'子分類層級','On a category page the filter lists its subcategories.'=>'在分類頁面上，篩選器會列出其子分類。','Step of the slider'=>'滑桿步長','Leave empty for the name of the filter.'=>'留空則使用篩選器名稱。','Hide the title'=>'隱藏標題','Collapsible'=>'可折疊','Yes, open'=>'是，展開','Yes, closed'=>'是，收起','Show the number of products'=>'顯示產品數量','Options before "Show more" (0 = all)'=>'「顯示更多」之前的選項數（0 = 全部）','Hide options without products'=>'隱藏沒有產品的選項','Otherwise they are greyed out. Options that no product of the page has are never shown.'=>'否則以灰色顯示。頁面中沒有任何產品具備的選項永遠不會顯示。','Envo Blocks PRO filters without reloading the page and adds brands, "On sale", swatches, buttons, dropdowns and a filter drawer for phones.'=>'Envo Blocks PRO 無需重新載入頁面即可篩選，並新增品牌、「促銷中」、色板、按鈕、下拉清單以及手機端篩選抽屜。','Active filters'=>'已選篩選','Shown only while a filter is on. The preview shows a sample.'=>'僅在啟用篩選時顯示。預覽中顯示示例。','Show "Clear all"'=>'顯示「全部清除」','Track your order'=>'追蹤您的訂單','Enter your order number and the email address you used at checkout. The order number is in the confirmation email.'=>'請輸入您的訂單號和結帳時使用的電子郵件地址。訂單號在確認郵件中。','The form is the WooCommerce order tracking: after a search the order and its updates appear in the same place.'=>'該表單是 WooCommerce 的訂單追蹤：搜尋後，訂單及其更新會顯示在同一位置。','Free shipping'=>'免運費','Amount for free shipping'=>'免運費金額','From WooCommerce "Free shipping" methods'=>'來自 WooCommerce 的「免運費」方式','Set here'=>'在此設定','Automatic uses the lowest minimum order amount of the Free shipping methods in your shipping zones.'=>'自動使用您配送區域中「免運費」方式的最低訂單金額。','Amount (in the shop currency)'=>'金額（商店貨幣）','Hide when free shipping is reached'=>'達到免運費後隱藏','Use {remaining} for the missing amount and {threshold} for the free shipping amount. Leave empty for the default text.'=>'使用 {remaining} 表示差額，使用 {threshold} 表示免運費金額。留空則使用預設文字。','While the amount is not reached'=>'未達到金額時','Add {remaining} more to get free shipping!'=>'再買 {remaining} 即可享受免運費！','When it is reached'=>'達到金額時','You have free shipping!'=>'您已享受免運費！','When the cart is empty'=>'購物車為空時','Free shipping on orders over {threshold}.'=>'訂單滿 {threshold} 免運費。','Text alignment'=>'文字對齊','Show progress bar'=>'顯示進度條','Bar when reached'=>'達到時的條形','Round heart'=>'圓形愛心','Bookmark'=>'書籤','The wishlist page could not be created.'=>'無法建立願望清單頁面。','Wishlist page:'=>'願望清單頁面：','Edit'=>'編輯','No wishlist page is set yet: this page becomes the wishlist page when it is published.'=>'尚未設定願望清單頁面：此頁面發布後將成為願望清單頁面。','You have no wishlist page yet. The "View" link after saving a product leads there.'=>'您還沒有願望清單頁面。儲存產品後的「查看」連結會指向那裡。','Create the wishlist page'=>'建立願望清單頁面','Set it in WooCommerce > Settings > Advanced'=>'在 WooCommerce > 設定 > 高級 中設定','Wishlist button'=>'願望清單按鈕','On the product page and in a product template (Product Collection) the button uses that product. Choose a product only to place the button somewhere else.'=>'在產品頁面和產品範本（Product Collection）中，按鈕使用該產品。僅在要將按鈕放在其他位置時才選擇產品。','Button with an icon and text'=>'帶圖示和文字的按鈕','Round icon'=>'圓形圖示','Icon and text (link style)'=>'圖示和文字（連結樣式）','Add to wishlist'=>'加入願望清單','Text when saved'=>'儲存後的文字','In your wishlist'=>'已在願望清單中','Icon and text'=>'圖示和文字','Icon when saved'=>'儲存後的圖示','Wishlist'=>'願望清單','The preview shows a few products of the shop; visitors see their own saved products.'=>'預覽顯示商店的幾件產品；訪客看到的是自己儲存的產品。','Grid of cards'=>'卡片網格','List (rows)'=>'清單（行）','Up to 3 on tablets, 2 on phones.'=>'平板最多 3 個，手機最多 2 個。','Products with options get a link to the product page.'=>'帶選項的產品會顯示指向產品頁面的連結。','Remove from the wishlist after adding to the cart'=>'加入購物車後從願望清單中移除','A share link, "Add all to cart", hearts on product images and a header icon with a drawer are in Envo Blocks PRO.'=>'分享連結、「全部加入購物車」、產品圖片上的愛心以及帶抽屜的頁首圖示位於 Envo Blocks PRO 中。','Empty wishlist'=>'空願望清單','Your wishlist is empty'=>'您的願望清單是空的','Tap the heart on any product to save it for later.'=>'點選任意產品上的愛心即可儲存以備後用。','The button leads to the shop.'=>'按鈕指向商店。','Continue shopping'=>'繼續購物','As in Envo Blocks > Payment QR Code'=>'與 Envo Blocks > Payment QR Code 中相同','Payment'=>'付款','QR code format'=>'QR 碼格式','Automatic: QR Platba for CZK, EPC QR for EUR'=>'自動：CZK 使用 QR Platba，EUR 使用 EPC QR','Only QR Platba (CZK)'=>'僅 QR Platba（CZK）','Only EPC QR (EUR)'=>'僅 EPC QR（EUR）','Orders in other currencies get no code.'=>'其他貨幣的訂單不生成QR 碼。','Account'=>'帳戶','The accounts with an IBAN from WooCommerce > Settings > Payments > Direct bank transfer.'=>'來自 WooCommerce > 設定 > 付款 > 直接銀行轉帳 中帶 IBAN 的帳戶。','Payment message'=>'付款附言','Placeholders: {order_number}, {order_id}, {site_title}. Empty = as in Envo Blocks > Payment QR Code.'=>'預留位置：{order_number}、{order_id}、{site_title}。留空 = 與 Envo Blocks > Payment QR Code 中相同。','Put the block in the Order Confirmation template. It shows only for orders paid by direct bank transfer that wait for the payment.'=>'將此區塊放入訂單確認範本中。僅對通過直接銀行轉帳付款且等待付款的訂單顯示。','Pay by QR code'=>'掃碼付款','Scan the code with the app of your bank: the account, amount and reference are filled in.'=>'用您銀行的應用掃描此碼：帳戶、金額和參考號會自動填寫。','Payment details'=>'付款詳情','Account, amount, variable symbol and message for entering the payment by hand.'=>'用於手動填寫付款的帳戶、金額、可變符號和附言。','Code beside the details'=>'QR 碼在詳情旁邊','Code above the details'=>'QR 碼在詳情上方','QR code size (px)'=>'QR 碼大小（px）','Empty = the document name and number, e.g. "Invoice 202600012 (PDF)".'=>'留空 = 文件名稱和編號，例如「發票 202600012（PDF）」。','Credit notes too'=>'也包括折讓單','Put the block in the Order Confirmation template. It shows when the invoice of the order is issued (Envo Blocks > Invoices).'=>'將此區塊放入訂單確認範本中。當訂單的發票開具後顯示（Envo Blocks > 發票）。','Additional information'=>'附加資訊','Reviews ({count})'=>'評價（{count}）','Own content (blocks)'=>'自定義內容（區塊）','The product\'s own tabs'=>'產品自身的分頁','Tabs of other plugins'=>'其他外掛的分頁','Content of the tab: text, images, a table, any blocks…'=>'分頁的內容：文字、圖片、表格、任意區塊…','Tab'=>'分頁','New tab'=>'新分頁','Tabs'=>'分頁','Every tab is a Product Tab block: click a tab to edit it, move it with the arrows of its toolbar or in the List View, add one with the + button. Tabs without content for a product (no description, no attributes, reviews off) are left out.'=>'每個分頁都是一個 Product Tab 區塊：點選分頁進行編輯，使用其工具欄中的箭頭或在清單檢視中移動它，用 + 按鈕新增新分頁。對某個產品沒有內容的分頁（沒有描述、沒有屬性、評價已關閉）會被省略。','Tabs of'=>'分頁對象','Headings inside the panels'=>'面板內的標題','The "Description" and "Additional information" headings WooCommerce prints above the text.'=>'WooCommerce 在文字上方顯示的「描述」和「附加資訊」標題。','Show as'=>'顯示為','Accordion'=>'手風琴','Tabs position'=>'分頁位置','Boxed'=>'帶框','Pills'=>'膠囊','Text only'=>'僅文字','Tabs alignment'=>'分頁對齊','Full width'=>'全寬','Width of the tabs column (px)'=>'分頁列的寬度（px）','Accordion on phones'=>'手機上使用手風琴','Below 782 px the tabs turn into an accordion.'=>'低於 782 px 時分頁變為手風琴。','First item open'=>'預設展開第一項','More items open at once'=>'可同時展開多項','The editor shows the items as tabs; the page shows the accordion.'=>'編輯器以分頁顯示各項；頁面上顯示為手風琴。','Space around the content (px)'=>'內容週圍的間距（px）','Tab text'=>'分頁文字','Active tab text'=>'活動分頁的文字','Accent (line, active pill)'=>'强調色（線條、活動膠囊）','Tab background'=>'分頁背景','Active tab background'=>'活動分頁的背景','Lines and borders'=>'線條和邊框','Content background'=>'內容背景','Content text'=>'內容文字','Adds its tabs only when the product has them.'=>'僅在產品有這些分頁時才新增。','Add tab'=>'新增分頁','Dimensions'=>'尺寸','Color'=>'顏色','Black, White'=>'黑色、白色','The reviews of the product and the form for a new review.'=>'產品的評價以及發表新評價的表單。','The tabs of the product (Products > Edit > Product data > Tabs), each as its own tab, here in the order. Nothing when the product has none.'=>'產品的分頁（產品 > 編輯 > 產品資料 > 分頁），每個作為單獨的分頁，按此處順序顯示。產品沒有時不顯示。','Tabs that other plugins add to WooCommerce products (e.g. vendor info, FAQ, size charts), each as its own tab. Nothing when there are none.'=>'其他外掛新增到 WooCommerce 產品的分頁（例如賣家資訊、常見問題、尺碼表），每個作為單獨的分頁。沒有時不顯示。','The description of the product (its main text) is shown here.'=>'此處顯示產品的描述（其主要文字）。','filled on the product page'=>'在產品頁面上填充','{count} is the number of reviews.'=>'{count} 為評價數量。','e.g. Shipping & returns'=>'例如 配送與退貨','Only for products in these categories'=>'僅限這些分類中的產品','Empty = every product.'=>'留空 = 所有產品。','How long does delivery take?'=>'配送需要多長時間？','Orders placed by 2 pm on a working day leave the same day. Delivery usually takes 1–3 working days.'=>'工作日 14:00 前下單當天發貨。配送通常需要 1–3 個工作日。','Can I return a product?'=>'可以退貨嗎？','Yes, within 30 days of delivery. Unused products in their original packaging get a full refund.'=>'可以，收貨後 30 天內均可退貨。未使用且包裝完好的商品全額退款。','Which payment methods do you accept?'=>'支援哪些付款方式？','Cards, Apple Pay and Google Pay, bank transfer and cash on delivery.'=>'銀行卡、Apple Pay 和 Google Pay、銀行轉帳以及貨到付款。','The answer: text, a list, an image, a button…'=>'回答：文字、清單、圖片、按鈕…','Questions'=>'問題','Every question is a FAQ Item block: type the question, the answer below it is made of blocks. Add a question with the + button, move it with the arrows of its toolbar. The editor shows all answers; the page shows them when a question is clicked.'=>'每個問題都是一個「FAQ 條目」區塊：輸入問題，下方的回答由區塊組成。用 + 按鈕新增問題，用其工具欄中的箭頭移動。編輯器顯示所有回答；頁面在點選問題時顯示。','First question open'=>'第一個問題展開','More questions open at once'=>'可同時展開多個問題','Off: opening a question closes the open one.'=>'關閉：展開一個問題會收起已展開的問題。','Question as'=>'問題標題級別','Heading 2'=>'標題 2','Heading 3'=>'標題 3','Heading 4'=>'標題 4','For the outline of the page; the look stays the same.'=>'用於頁面大綱；外觀保持不變。','FAQ data for search engines'=>'搜尋引擎 FAQ 資料','Adds schema.org FAQPage data (JSON-LD) with the questions and answers to the page. Turn it off when an SEO plugin already adds FAQ data for this page.'=>'向頁面新增含問題和回答的 schema.org FAQPage 資料（JSON-LD）。如果 SEO 外掛已為此頁面新增 FAQ 資料，請關閉。','Cards'=>'卡片','One box'=>'單個方框','Lines'=>'線條','Plus / minus'=>'加號 / 減號','Arrow'=>'箭頭','Space between questions (px)'=>'問題間距（px）','Inner space (px)'=>'內距（px）','Question text'=>'問題文字','Background of the open question'=>'展開問題的背景','Answer text'=>'回答文字','FAQ Item'=>'FAQ 條目','Question'=>'問題','Open when the page loads'=>'頁面載入時展開','Question…'=>'問題…','Customers ask on the product page; you answer in Envo Blocks › Settings › Product Questions. Only answered questions are shown.'=>'顧客在商品頁面提問；您在「Envo Blocks › 設定 › 商品問答」中回答。只顯示已回答的問題。','Questions of'=>'問題來源','Questions & answers'=>'問答','Questions before "Show more"'=>'「顯示更多」前的問題數','Search field'=>'搜尋框','From 4 answered questions.'=>'已回答問題達到 4 個時顯示。','"Ask a question" form'=>'「提問」表單','Accent (Q / A, buttons)'=>'强調色（Q / A、按鈕）','Loading…'=>'正在載入…','Other form (shortcode)'=>'其他表單（短代碼）','No supported form plugin is active. Install Contact Form 7, WPForms, Fluent Forms, Ninja Forms, Formidable Forms, Forminator or Gravity Forms, or paste the shortcode of another form.'=>'沒有啟用受支援的表單外掛。請安裝 Contact Form 7、WPForms、Fluent Forms、Ninja Forms、Formidable Forms、Forminator 或 Gravity Forms，或者黏貼其他表單的短代碼。','The form plugin keeps the fields, e-mails and entries; this block gives the form your look.'=>'欄位、郵件和提交紀錄仍由表單外掛管理；此區塊為表單套用您的外觀。','Form plugin'=>'表單外掛','Form shortcode'=>'表單短代碼','One shortcode only, for example [my_form id="3"]. The fields get the look of the block; how well depends on the form plugin.'=>'僅限一個短代碼，例如 [my_form id="3"]。欄位會套用區塊的外觀，效果取决於表單外掛。','Form'=>'表單','This plugin has no published form yet. Make one in its menu and come back.'=>'此外掛還沒有已發布的表單。請在外掛選單中建立表單後再回來。','This form plugin is not active.'=>'此表單外掛未啟用。','Fields'=>'欄位','Field style'=>'欄位樣式','Filled'=>'填充','Line under the field'=>'欄位下方的線條','One column'=>'一欄','Two columns (short fields side by side)'=>'兩列（短欄位並排）','Label size (px, 0 = as the text)'=>'標籤大小（px，0 = 與正文相同）','Corner radius'=>'圓角','Space inside the fields'=>'欄位內距','Border width'=>'邊框粗細','Space between the fields'=>'欄位間距','Width'=>'寬度','By the text'=>'按文字寬度','Corner radius (-1 = as the theme buttons)'=>'圓角（-1 = 與主題按鈕相同）','Labels and fields'=>'標籤和欄位','Field text'=>'欄位文字','Field background'=>'欄位背景','Field border'=>'欄位邊框','Active field, checkboxes'=>'當前欄位、核取方塊','Button colors'=>'按鈕顏色','Background on hover'=>'懸停時的背景','Text on hover'=>'懸停時的文字','Sent'=>'已發送','Errors'=>'錯誤','Languages'=>'語言','Shows the languages of WPML, Polylang or TranslatePress, in their order. Each link opens the same page in the other language.'=>'按順序顯示 WPML、Polylang 或 TranslatePress 的語言。每個連結都會以另一種語言打開同一頁面。','Row of links'=>'一行連結','Flag and name'=>'國旗和名稱','Flag'=>'國旗','Flag and code'=>'國旗和代碼','Code (EN, DE)'=>'代碼（EN、DE）','Flag shape'=>'國旗形狀','Rectangle'=>'矩形','Circle'=>'圓形','Hide the current language'=>'隱藏當前語言','Hide languages without a translation of the page'=>'隱藏沒有該頁面翻译的語言','WPML and Polylang: otherwise such a language links to its home page.'=>'WPML 和 Polylang：否則該語言會連結到它的首頁。','Menu opens to the'=>'選單展開方向','Right (aligned left)'=>'向右（左對齊）','Left (aligned right)'=>'向左（右對齊）','Current language and hover'=>'當前語言和懸停','Menu background'=>'選單背景','Menu text'=>'選單文字','Switch'=>'開關','Visitors choose whether the prices are shown with or without tax; every price of the store follows. Shows only when WooCommerce calculates taxes. More in Envo Blocks › Settings › Tax Switcher.'=>'訪客可選擇以含稅或不含稅顯示價格；商店中的每個價格都會隨之變化。僅在 WooCommerce 計算稅費時顯示。詳見「Envo Blocks › 設定 › 含稅切換」。','Two buttons'=>'兩個按鈕','Order of the options'=>'選項順序','With tax first'=>'含稅在前','Without tax first'=>'不含稅在前','Text for prices with tax'=>'含稅價格的文字','Empty = "Incl. VAT" (or "Incl. Tax", by the country of the store).'=>'留空 =「含增值稅」（或根據商店所在國家顯示「含稅」）。','Text for prices without tax'=>'不含稅價格的文字','Empty = "Excl. VAT" (or "Excl. Tax").'=>'留空 =「不含增值稅」（或「不含稅」）。','Show a label'=>'顯示標籤','Label'=>'標籤','Active background'=>'當前選項背景','Active text'=>'當前選項文字','Summer collection'=>'夏季系列','Light fabrics and bright colors for warm days.'=>'輕薄面料與明快色彩，適合溫暖的日子。','Shop now'=>'立即選購','Choose an image or a video'=>'選擇圖片或影片','Replace the background'=>'替換背景','Remove the background'=>'移除背景','Focal point'=>'焦點','Alternative text'=>'替代文字','Describe the image if it says something the text does not; leave it empty for a decorative background.'=>'如果圖片表達了文字中沒有的內容，請描述它；裝飾性背景請留空。','Overlay opacity (%)'=>'遮罩不透明度（%）','A darker overlay keeps light text readable on any photo. Its color is under Styles.'=>'較深的遮罩可讓淺色文字在任何照片上都清晰易讀。其顏色在「樣式」中設定。','Parallax'=>'視差','Effect while scrolling'=>'捲動時的效果','Parallax (the background moves slower)'=>'視差（背景移動得更慢）','Zoom (the background grows)'=>'縮放（背景逐漸放大）','None (a still background)'=>'無（靜止的背景）','Strength'=>'强度','Reverse (from bigger to normal)'=>'反向（從放大到正常）','Reverse (the background moves faster than the page)'=>'反向（背景比頁面移動得更快）','Also on phones'=>'手機上也顯示','Off: a still background on screens up to 781 px.'=>'關閉：在 781 px 及以下的螢幕上背景保持靜止。','The effect runs on the site; the editor shows a still background. Visitors who turned on "reduce motion" in their system see a still background too.'=>'效果在網站上運行；編輯器中顯示靜止的背景。在系統中開啟「減弱動態效果」的訪客也會看到靜止的背景。','Size and content'=>'尺寸和內容','Minimum height'=>'最小高度','Minimum height (% of the screen)'=>'最小高度（螢幕的 %）','Minimum height (px)'=>'最小高度（px）','Content width (px)'=>'內容寬度（px）','0 = the content width of the theme.'=>'0 = 主題的內容寬度。','Content position'=>'內容位置','Overlay'=>'遮罩','Background without an image'=>'無圖片時的背景','On this page'=>'本頁內容','Overview'=>'概覽','Details'=>'詳情','Sticking'=>'固定','The blocks stay in view inside the column or group this block is in, until its end. Put it in the shorter column of a Columns block. The editor shows it without sticking.'=>'這些區塊會在本區塊所在的欄或組中保持可見，直到其末尾。請把它放在分欄區塊中較短的一欄裡。編輯器中顯示為不固定。','Space at the top'=>'頂部間距','Below a sticky header (automatic)'=>'在固定頁首下方（自動）','From the top of the screen'=>'從螢幕頂部開始','Extra space (px)'=>'額外間距（px）','Space from the top (px)'=>'距頂部的距離（px）','Space at the bottom (px)'=>'底部間距（px）','For content taller than the screen: it floats – while scrolling down it stops this far above the bottom, while scrolling up at the top.'=>'內容高於螢幕時：它會浮動——向下捲動時停在距底部這麼遠的位置，向上捲動時停在頂部。','Sticky on'=>'固定於','Computers and tablets'=>'電腦和平板','Computers only'=>'僅電腦','Every screen, phones too'=>'所有螢幕，包括手機','Documentation'=>'文件','Contact support'=>'聯繫支援','There is nothing to export. Add some blocks first.'=>'沒有可匯出的內容。請先新增一些區塊。','Preparing the ZIP file with the images…'=>'正在準備包含圖片的 ZIP 檔案…','Page exported as ZIP with %d image.'=>'頁面已匯出為包含 %d 張圖片的 ZIP。','Page exported as JSON.'=>'頁面已匯出為 JSON。','This will replace the current content of the page. Continue?'=>'這將替換頁面的當前內容。是否繼續？','Buy PRO'=>'購買 PRO','Activate License'=>'啟用授權','Renew License'=>'續訂授權','PRO'=>'PRO','%d more page'=>'還有 %d 個頁面','%1$s: %2$d more pages'=>'%1$s：還有 %2$d 個頁面','%1$s: page %2$s'=>'%1$s：第 %2$s 頁','Open template %s'=>'打開範本 %s','%d page'=>'%d 個頁面','Live demo'=>'線上展示','Choose pages'=>'選擇頁面','Select'=>'選擇','Active'=>'已啟用','Installed, not active'=>'已安裝，未啟用','Not installed'=>'未安裝','Download ZIP'=>'下載 ZIP','Then upload it in Appearance > Themes > Add New > Upload Theme.'=>'然後在 外觀 > 主題 > 新增新主題 > 上傳主題 中上傳。','Then upload it in Plugins > Add New > Upload Plugin.'=>'然後在 外掛 > 新增新外掛 > 上傳外掛 中上傳。','Install & activate'=>'安裝並啟用','Install'=>'安裝','Activate'=>'啟用','Ask an administrator'=>'請聯繫管理員','%s – the theme our templates are made for'=>'%s – 我們的範本專為此主題打造','A free block theme for WooCommerce. With it the templates look exactly like the demos; with another theme the fonts, spacing and shop pages can look different.'=>'一款適用於 WooCommerce 的免費區塊主題。使用它，範本看起來與示範完全一致；使用其他主題時，字型、間距和商店頁面可能會有所不同。','A free block theme for WooCommerce from WordPress.org. With it the templates look exactly like the demos; with another theme the fonts, spacing and shop pages can look different. Your pages and products stay when you switch.'=>'一款來自 WordPress.org、適用於 WooCommerce 的免費區塊主題。使用它，範本看起來與示範完全一致；使用其他主題時，字型、間距和商店頁面可能會有所不同。切換主題後，您的頁面和產品都會保留。','Store in 5 minutes'=>'5 分鐘開店','Hide'=>'隱藏','Import the header and footer of the template'=>'匯入範本的頁首和頁尾','The page gets the header and footer of the demo store.'=>'頁面將使用展示商店的頁首和頁尾。','Only the content between them is imported; the page shows the header and footer of your theme.'=>'僅匯入兩者之間的內容；頁面顯示您主題的頁首和頁尾。','Canvas page: the header and footer of your theme are not shown, only the imported content.'=>'畫布頁面：不顯示您主題的頁首和頁尾，僅顯示匯入的內容。','This template has its own header and footer.'=>'此範本有自己的頁首和頁尾。','This template has its own header and footer. Choose a canvas page template, otherwise the header and footer of your theme are shown as well.'=>'此範本有自己的頁首和頁尾。請選擇畫布頁面範本，否則您主題的頁首和頁尾也會顯示。','This template has its own header and footer, and your theme has no canvas template for this type of content: the header and footer of your theme are shown as well. You can delete either of them after the import.'=>'此範本有自己的頁首和頁尾，而您的主題沒有適用於此類內容的畫布範本：您主題的頁首和頁尾也會顯示。匯入後可以刪除其中之一。','Page template'=>'頁面範本','canvas'=>'畫布','Import "%s"'=>'匯入「%s」','Importing…'=>'正在匯入…','Reload the editor and import'=>'重新載入編輯器並匯入','Preview of %s'=>'%s 的預覽','No preview image'=>'無預覽圖片','Pages of the template'=>'範本的頁面','All templates'=>'所有範本','Only the layout, texts and settings of the page are imported. Products, categories, reviews, coupons and other dynamic content are not imported: the blocks load the content of your own store.'=>'僅匯入頁面的布局、文字和設定。產品、分類、評價、優惠券和其他動態內容不會匯入：區塊會載入您自己商店的內容。','Required plugins'=>'必需外掛','The pages use blocks of these plugins. They must be active before you import.'=>'這些頁面使用了以下外掛的區塊。匯入前必須啟用它們。','Recommended plugins'=>'推薦外掛','Recommended theme'=>'推薦主題','The template was designed with this theme. Activating a theme changes the look of the whole site.'=>'此範本是使用該主題設計的。啟用主題會改變整個網站的外觀。','Activate the required plugins first: %s.'=>'請先啟用必需外掛：%s。','This is a PRO template. Activate your PRO license to preview and import it.'=>'這是 PRO 範本。請啟用您的 PRO 授權以預覽和匯入。','This is a PRO template. Your PRO license has expired; renew it to preview and import the template.'=>'這是 PRO 範本。您的 PRO 授權已過期；請續訂以預覽和匯入該範本。','This is a PRO template. It is included in Envo Blocks PRO.'=>'這是 PRO 範本。它包含在 Envo Blocks PRO 中。','Importing creates a new draft post or page with this content and opens it in the editor. Nothing else on your site changes.'=>'匯入會使用此內容建立新的草稿文章或頁面，並在編輯器中打開。網站上的其他內容不會改變。','Importing replaces the current content of the page you are editing. To add only a part of a page, use Sections.'=>'匯入會替換您正在編輯的頁面的當前內容。如果只想新增頁面的一部分，請使用「區段」。','New plugins were activated. The editor reloads to load their blocks; your changes are saved as a draft first.'=>'新外掛已啟用。編輯器將重新載入以載入它們的區塊；您的更改會先儲存為草稿。','Opens this page in a new tab with your theme and your products, without changing the page you are editing.'=>'在新標籤頁中以您的主題和產品打開此頁面，不會更改您正在編輯的頁面。','Preparing…'=>'正在準備…','Preview'=>'預覽','Open the live demo'=>'打開線上展示','PRO – activate your license'=>'PRO – 請啟用您的授權','PRO – license expired'=>'PRO – 授權已過期','Included in Envo Blocks PRO'=>'包含在 Envo Blocks PRO 中','Live demo of %s (opens in a new tab)'=>'%s 的線上展示（在新標籤頁中打開）','Use %s'=>'使用 %s','Insert %s'=>'插入 %s','Needs %s'=>'需要 %s','Creating…'=>'正在建立…','Use'=>'使用','Inserting…'=>'正在插入…','Insert'=>'插入','Free or PRO'=>'免費或 PRO','All'=>'全部','Free'=>'免費','Show all'=>'顯示全部','Categories'=>'分類','It does not contain anything that can be used on this site.'=>'其中沒有可在此網站上使用的內容。','"%s" inserted.'=>'已插入「%s」。','This makes a new store layout and opens it. Changes of this page that are not saved are lost. Go on?'=>'這將建立新的商店布局並打開它。此頁面未儲存的更改將丟失。是否繼續？','The layout could not be created.'=>'無法建立布局。','Activate the theme "%s"? It changes the look of the whole site.'=>'啟用主題「%s」？這會改變整個網站的外觀。','The template does not contain any usable blocks.'=>'該範本不包含任何可用的區塊。','The preview could not be created.'=>'無法建立預覽。','"%s" imported.'=>'已匯入「%s」。','The file could not be read.'=>'無法讀取該檔案。','The file does not contain any usable blocks.'=>'該檔案不包含任何可用的區塊。','What to import'=>'匯入內容','Templates'=>'範本','Sections'=>'區段','Presets'=>'預設','Layouts'=>'布局','Designs of the product page, the shop, the cart, the side cart, the checkout, the order received page and My account. "Use" makes a store layout of the design and opens it; it is used on the store once you publish it.'=>'產品頁、商店、購物車、側邊購物車、結帳、訂單已收到頁面和我的帳戶的設計。「使用」會根據設計建立商店布局並打開；發布後即在商店中使用。','Ready-made settings of the blocks of this plugin, as in the block demos. They are inserted after the selected block, or at the end of the page.'=>'本外掛區塊的現成設定，與區塊展示中相同。插入到所選區塊之後，或頁面末尾。','Sections are inserted after the selected block, or at the end of the page. The rest of the page stays as it is.'=>'區段插入到所選區塊之後，或頁面末尾。頁面的其餘部分保持不變。','No layouts found.'=>'未找到布局。','No presets found.'=>'未找到預設。','No sections found.'=>'未找到區段。','Choose a template to see its pages and what it needs. Each page is imported into a new draft post or page.'=>'選擇一個範本以查看其頁面和所需內容。每個頁面都會匯入到新的草稿文章或頁面中。','Choose a template to see its pages, what it needs and to import a page into the page you are editing.'=>'選擇一個範本以查看其頁面和所需內容，並將頁面匯入您正在編輯的頁面。','No templates found.'=>'未找到範本。','Layout designs'=>'布局設計','Search layouts…'=>'搜尋布局…','Search presets…'=>'搜尋預設…','Search sections…'=>'搜尋區段…','Search templates…'=>'搜尋範本…','Search layouts'=>'搜尋布局','Search presets'=>'搜尋預設','Search sections'=>'搜尋區段','Search templates'=>'搜尋範本','Import a JSON or ZIP file made by Export as JSON / Export as ZIP, or sent by our support.'=>'匯入由「匯出為 JSON / 匯出為 ZIP」生成或由我們的支援團隊發送的 JSON 或 ZIP 檔案。','Import from file'=>'從檔案匯入','Close'=>'關閉','The draft could not be created.'=>'無法建立草稿。','Import the file'=>'匯入檔案','A new draft is created with this content and opened in the editor.'=>'將使用此內容建立新草稿並在編輯器中打開。','Create as'=>'建立為','Cancel'=>'取消','Create and import'=>'建立並匯入','Export as JSON'=>'匯出為 JSON','Export as ZIP (with images)'=>'匯出為 ZIP（含圖片）','Templates Import'=>'Templates Import','Breadcrumbs'=>'面包屑','Separator'=>'分隔符','The editor shows a sample path; the store shows the real one.'=>'編輯器顯示示例路徑；商店中顯示真實路徑。','Shop toolbar'=>'商店工具欄','Sorting'=>'排序','Bar with a line'=>'帶線條的欄','Rounded'=>'圓角','Shown on the shop, the product categories and tags, and the product search. Put a Product Collection that inherits the query below it.'=>'顯示在商店、產品分類和標籤以及產品搜尋中。請在其下方放置繼承查詢的 Product Collection。','Order received'=>'訂單已收到','Receipt'=>'收據','Minimal'=>'極簡','Two columns'=>'兩列','Thank-you message of WooCommerce'=>'WooCommerce 的感謝消息','Addresses'=>'地址','Shown on the order received page; the editor shows your newest order or a sample.'=>'顯示在訂單已收到頁面；編輯器顯示您最新的訂單或示例。','Accent'=>'强調色','My account'=>'我的帳戶','Menu'=>'選單','Sidebar'=>'側邊欄','Tabs above'=>'上方分頁','Tiles'=>'圖塊','Compact list'=>'緊湊清單','Visitors who are not signed in see the login and register forms in the same style.'=>'未登入的訪客會看到相同樣式的登入和註冊表單。','Checkout form'=>'結帳表單','Two columns (form and summary)'=>'兩欄（表單和摘要）','Summary on top'=>'摘要在上','The summary stays in view while scrolling'=>'捲動時摘要保持可見','Summary in a box'=>'摘要放在框中','Shows the WooCommerce checkout of your store (the Checkout block or the classic checkout) with your payment methods, shipping and coupons. Edit its fields on the checkout page. The editor shows a sketch.'=>'顯示您商店的 WooCommerce 結帳（Checkout 區塊或經典結帳），包括您的付款方式、配送和優惠券。其欄位在結帳頁面上編輯。編輯器中顯示草圖。','Checkout header'=>'結帳頁首','Logo, note and link in a row'=>'標誌、提示和連結在一行','Centered'=>'居中','Logo (or the site name)'=>'標誌（或站點名稱）','Logo width (px)'=>'標誌寬度（px）','Secure checkout note'=>'安全結帳提示','Secure checkout'=>'安全結帳','Link back to the cart'=>'返回購物車連結','Back to cart'=>'返回購物車','The logo of Appearance › Customize › Site Identity (or the Site Logo block of the Site Editor).'=>'來自 外觀 › 自定義 › 站點身份 的標誌（或站點編輯器的 Site Logo 區塊）。','Shown in the side cart panel and filled with the visitor’s cart in the browser; the editor shows a sample.'=>'顯示在側邊購物車面板中，並在瀏覽器中填入訪客的購物車；編輯器顯示示例。','Cart items'=>'購物車商品','Heading text'=>'標題文字','Your cart'=>'您的購物車','Number of items'=>'商品數量','List'=>'清單','Compact'=>'緊湊','Images'=>'圖片','Quantity buttons'=>'數量按鈕','Remove links'=>'移除連結','Text of an empty cart'=>'空購物車的文字','Your cart is empty.'=>'您的購物車是空的。','Start shopping button (empty cart)'=>'「開始購物」按鈕（空購物車）','Cart summary'=>'購物車摘要','Savings (sale prices and coupons)'=>'節省（促銷價和優惠券）','Coupon field'=>'優惠券欄','Note'=>'備注','Note text'=>'備注文字','Shipping and taxes are calculated at checkout.'=>'運費和稅費在結帳時計算。','Under each other'=>'上下排列','Side by side'=>'並排','Checkout + a View cart link'=>'結帳 + 「查看購物車」連結','View cart'=>'查看購物車','Checkout'=>'結帳','Checkout button text'=>'結帳按鈕文字','Stick to the bottom of the panel'=>'固定在面板底部','On the store this page shows the store layout "%s": changes of the main part of this template are not visible there (the header and footer are).'=>'在商店中，此頁面顯示商店布局「%s」：此範本主體部分的更改在那裡不可見（頁首和頁尾可見）。','On the store some of these pages (chosen categories, tags or products) show the store layout "%s" instead of the main part of this template.'=>'在商店中，其中一些頁面（所選分類、標籤或產品）顯示商店布局「%s」，而不是此範本的主體部分。','Edit the layout'=>'編輯布局','Store Layouts'=>'商店布局','Get Envo Blocks PRO'=>'獲取 Envo Blocks PRO','%s is a Envo Blocks PRO block'=>'%s 是 Envo Blocks PRO 區塊','Remove block'=>'移除區塊','This placeholder is not shown on your site.'=>'此預留位置不會在您的網站上顯示。','Switched to Envo Blocks Store. Your pages and colours stayed as they were.'=>'已切換到 Envo Blocks Store。您的頁面和顏色保持不變。','Shop'=>'商店','Cart'=>'購物車','Terms and conditions'=>'條款和條件','Privacy policy'=>'隱私政策','— None —'=>'— 無 —','+ Create a starting draft'=>'+ 建立初始草稿','+ Create a new page'=>'+ 建立新頁面','draft'=>'草稿','A page with the main points and your store details, marked to be checked before you start selling.'=>'一個包含要點和商店資訊的頁面，已標記為在開始銷售前需要檢查。','WooCommerce makes the page with the right content.'=>'WooCommerce 會建立內容正確的頁面。','This page has no %s block – choose a page marked ✓ or create a new one.'=>'此頁面沒有 %s 區塊 – 請選擇標有 ✓ 的頁面，或建立一個新頁面。','Draft – published when you save.'=>'草稿 – 儲存時發布。','View ↗'=>'查看 ↗','No page – WooCommerce leaves it out.'=>'無頁面 – WooCommerce 會將其省略。','Theme'=>'主題','Template'=>'範本','Your colours'=>'您的顏色','Import'=>'匯入','Your store'=>'您的商店','Done'=>'完成','Pick a template and your brand colour – we set up the pages and colours of the whole store.'=>'選擇一個範本和您的品牌色 – 我們會為您設定整個商店的頁面和顏色。','You are using Envo Blocks Store'=>'您正在使用 Envo Blocks Store','The theme our templates are made for – the store will look exactly like the demo.'=>'我們的範本專為此主題製作 – 商店看起來會和展示完全一樣。','Continue'=>'繼續','(current)'=>'（當前）','Strongly recommended'=>'强烈推薦','Our templates are designed with this theme. Choose it and your store looks exactly like the demo you pick – from the first click.'=>'我們的範本是用這個主題設計的。選擇它，您的商店從第一次點選起就和所選展示完全一樣。','Fonts, spacing and buttons match the template 1:1'=>'字型、間距和按鈕與範本完全一致','Shop, product, cart and checkout pages in the same style'=>'商店、商品、購物車和結帳頁面風格統一','Your brand colour reaches every page, not only the home page'=>'品牌色覆蓋每個頁面，而不只是首頁','Free, made by us – tested with every Envo Blocks release'=>'免費，由我們製作 – 隨每個 Envo Blocks 版本測試','Install and use %s'=>'安裝並使用 %s','Free from WordPress.org – installed and activated for you.'=>'從 WordPress.org 免費獲取 – 我們會為您安裝並啟用。','The theme is not installed on this site yet. Ask an administrator to install it.'=>'此網站尚未安裝該主題。請聯繫管理員安裝。','The theme is not installed on this site yet.'=>'此網站尚未安裝該主題。','How to get the theme ↗'=>'如何獲取主題 ↗','Your current theme: %s. You can switch back any time in Appearance › Themes.'=>'您當前的主題：%s。您可以隨時在「外觀 › 主題」中切換回來。','Try your luck with another theme'=>'試試其他主題','The template brings its own header and footer, so it will work. Fonts, spacing and the shop pages come from the theme, though, and may not match. Not happy with the result? You can switch to Envo Blocks Store later with one click.'=>'範本自帶頁首和頁尾，因此可以正常使用。但字型、間距和商店頁面來自主題，可能不太匹配。對結果不滿意？以後可以一鍵切換到 Envo Blocks Store。','Continue with this theme'=>'繼續使用此主題','No thanks, I will try my luck with another theme'=>'不用了，我想試試其他主題','%1$d of %2$d templates'=>'%1$d / %2$d 個範本','%d templates'=>'%d 個範本','Activate your PRO license'=>'啟用您的 PRO 授權','Renew your PRO license'=>'續訂您的 PRO 授權','Needs Envo Blocks PRO'=>'需要 Envo Blocks PRO','%d pages: %s'=>'%d 個頁面：%s','Use this template'=>'使用此範本','Live demo ↗'=>'線上展示 ↗','Pick the template closest to your store. Your products are put into it, and you change the colours in the next step.'=>'選擇最接近您商店的範本。您的商品會放入其中，顏色在下一步更改。',