後可以再次運行精靈新增其他頁面。','Pages'=>'頁面','Links of the template to pages you leave out go to the front page.'=>'範本中指向您未選頁面的連結將指向首頁。','Home'=>'首頁','Front page'=>'首頁','Without Home your front page stays as it is now.'=>'不選首頁時，您的首頁保持現狀。','Header'=>'頁首','Logo, menu, search, cart and the bar above them.'=>'標誌、選單、搜尋、購物車及其上方的橫條。','Footer'=>'頁尾','Links, contacts and payment icons at the bottom.'=>'底部的連結、聯繫方式和付款圖示。','← Colours'=>'← 顏色','Save changes'=>'儲存更改','Build my store'=>'建立我的商店','WooCommerce is not active – there is nothing to set up here.'=>'WooCommerce 未啟用 – 這裡沒有需要設定的內容。','A few basics of your shop. Everything can be changed later in WooCommerce › Settings – or skip this step.'=>'商店的幾項基本設定。以後都可以在「WooCommerce › 設定」中更改 – 也可以跳過此步驟。','Country and currency'=>'國家和貨幣','Filled in from the language of your site. Prices are shown the way that country writes them.'=>'根據您網站的語言填寫。價格會按照該國家的寫法顯示。','Your store is in'=>'您的商店所在國家','Currency'=>'貨幣','Store address'=>'商店地址','optional – for invoices, e-mails and taxes'=>'可選 – 用於發票、郵件和稅費','Address line 1'=>'地址第 1 行','Address line 2 (optional)'=>'地址第 2 行（可選）','City'=>'城市','Postcode'=>'郵政編碼','State / region'=>'省份 / 地區','Shown on invoices and in the order e-mails; WooCommerce also counts taxes from it. The country is the one chosen above.'=>'顯示在發票和訂單郵件中；WooCommerce 也會據此計算稅費。國家為上方所選。','Payments'=>'付款','Bank transfer with a QR code'=>'帶 QR 碼的銀行轉帳','The customer scans the QR code on the thank-you page or in the order e-mail and the payment is filled in for them.'=>'顧客在感謝頁面或訂單郵件中掃描QR 碼，付款資訊會自動填好。','Account holder'=>'帳戶持有人','BIC / SWIFT (optional)'=>'BIC / SWIFT（可選）','Without an IBAN the transfer is on, but there is no QR code yet.'=>'沒有 IBAN 時銀行轉帳仍會啟用，但暫時沒有QR 碼。','Cash on delivery'=>'貨到付款','The customer pays the courier.'=>'顧客向快遞員付款。','Delivery within %s'=>'%s 境內配送','One shipping zone with a price and free delivery from an amount. The free shipping bar of your template shows this amount by itself.'=>'一個配送區域，設定運費和滿額免運費。範本中的免運費橫條會自動顯示這個金額。','Free from'=>'滿額免運費','Leave “Free from” empty for no free delivery.'=>'如果不提供免運費，請將「滿額免運費」留空。','Sample products'=>'範例商品','Your store already has %d sample products.'=>'您的商店已有 %d 個範例商品。','Add 6 sample products'=>'新增 6 個範例商品','So the template’s product blocks are not empty while you add your own. Named “Sample product – …”, in the category “Sample products”, with the WooCommerce placeholder picture. Your store has %d products now.'=>'這樣在您新增自己的商品之前，範本的商品區塊不會是空的。名稱為「範例商品 – …」，位於「範例商品」分類中，使用 WooCommerce 的占位圖片。您的商店現有 %d 個商品。','Later one click deletes all samples you did not edit; an edited sample stays as your product.'=>'以後一鍵即可刪除所有未編輯的範例；編輯過的範例會作為您的商品保留。','Store pages'=>'商店頁面','The pages WooCommerce uses for the shop, cart, checkout and customer accounts, and the terms and privacy policy the checkout links to. Pick your own page or let the wizard create one.'=>'WooCommerce 用於商店、購物車、結帳和顧客帳戶的頁面，以及結帳頁面連結到的條款和隱私政策。選擇您自己的頁面，或讓精靈建立一個。','Skip this step'=>'跳過此步驟','Save and finish'=>'儲存並完成','Your store is ready'=>'您的商店已準備就緒','The pages are published, the template home page is your front page and the brand colours are set for the whole site.'=>'頁面已發布，範本的首頁已成為您的首頁，品牌色已應用到整個網站。','View my store ↗'=>'查看我的商店 ↗','Edit the home page'=>'編輯首頁','Change colours'=>'更改顏色','Not happy with the result?'=>'對結果不滿意？','Try %s'=>'試試 %s','Your template was made for our theme. With %s the fonts, spacing and shop pages can look different from the demo. One click switches the theme – your pages, products and colours stay.'=>'您的範本是為我們的主題製作的。使用 %s 時，字型、間距和商店頁面可能與展示不同。一鍵即可切換主題 – 您的頁面、商品和顏色都會保留。','Switch to %s'=>'切換到 %s','You can switch back any time in Appearance › Themes.'=>'您可以隨時在「外觀 › 主題」中切換回來。','Set up your store'=>'設定您的商店','Country and currency, bank transfer with a QR code, cash on delivery, delivery prices with free delivery, sample products.'=>'國家和貨幣、帶 QR 碼的銀行轉帳、貨到付款、含免運費的運費、範例商品。','Set up the store →'=>'設定商店 →','Sample products in your store: %1$d (not edited: %2$d).'=>'您商店中的範例商品：%1$d 個（未編輯：%2$d 個）。','Delete the unedited sample products (%d)'=>'刪除未編輯的範例商品（%d）','Samples you edited stay – they are your products now.'=>'您編輯過的範例會保留 – 它們現在是您的商品。','Undo everything the wizard did'=>'復原精靈所做的一切','Puts back your theme, front page, store name and colours; the template pages go to the trash.'=>'恢復您的主題、首頁、商店名稱和顏色；範本頁面移至回收桶。','More store settings'=>'更多商店設定','Everything the wizard set and much more – whenever you need it.'=>'精靈設定的一切以及更多 – 隨時可用。','Store layouts'=>'商店布局','Your own design of the product page, shop, cart, checkout, side cart, thank-you page and My account – built from blocks, for the whole store or only some products and categories.'=>'為商品頁面、商店、購物車、結帳、側邊購物車、感謝頁面和「我的帳戶」打造您自己的設計 – 由區塊構建，適用於整個商店或僅部分商品和分類。','Open Store Layouts →'=>'打開商店布局 →','WooCommerce'=>'WooCommerce','Envo Blocks'=>'Envo Blocks','Installing %s from WordPress.org…'=>'正在從 WordPress.org 安裝 %s…','Switching the theme…'=>'正在切換主題…','Preparing %s…'=>'正在準備 %s…','Page %1$d of %2$d: %3$s – matching your products and copying images'=>'第 %1$d / %2$d 頁：%3$s – 正在匹配您的商品並複製圖片','Building your store…'=>'正在建立您的商店…','Setting up your store…'=>'正在設定您的商店…','Your store settings are saved.'=>'您的商店設定已儲存。','Deleting the sample products…'=>'正在刪除範例商品…','Sample products deleted: %d.'=>'已刪除的範例商品：%d 個。','Kept because you edited them: %d.'=>'因您編輯過而保留：%d 個。','Checking what goes back…'=>'正在檢查要恢復的內容…','Undoing…'=>'正在復原…','Undo everything the wizard did?'=>'復原精靈所做的一切？','You changed these after the wizard – undo replaces your changes:'=>'您在精靈之後更改了以下內容 – 復原會覆蓋您的更改：','What goes back:'=>'將恢復的內容：','Nothing to put back.'=>'沒有需要恢復的內容。','Pictures copied into the Media Library stay there. Pages and products go to the trash, so you can restore them.'=>'複製到媒體庫的圖片會保留。頁面和商品會移至回收桶，您可以從那裡恢復。','Keep everything'=>'全部保留','Undo anyway'=>'仍然復原','Undo everything'=>'全部復原','block title' . "\4" . 'Active Filters'=>'已選篩選','block description' . "\4" . 'The chosen filters of the shop as chips – a click removes one – and "Clear all". Shown only while a filter is on.'=>'以標籤顯示商店中