變體。','block keyword' . "\4" . 'inventory'=>'存貨','block keyword' . "\4" . 'scarcity'=>'稀缺','block keyword' . "\4" . 'left'=>'剩餘','block keyword' . "\4" . 'quantity'=>'數量','The stock of the current product is shown here on the product page.'=>'當前產品的庫存將顯示在產品頁面的此處。','WooCommerce does not count the stock of this product. Turn on "Manage stock?" in its Inventory settings to show how many are left.'=>'WooCommerce 未統計此產品的庫存。請在其庫存設定中開啟「管理庫存？」以顯示剩餘數量。','block title' . "\4" . 'Store Breadcrumbs'=>'商店面包屑','block description' . "\4" . 'The WooCommerce breadcrumbs (Home / Shop / Category / Product) for store layouts and any page.'=>'用於商店布局和任意頁面的 WooCommerce 面包屑（首頁 / 商店 / 分類 / 產品）。','block keyword' . "\4" . 'breadcrumbs'=>'面包屑','block keyword' . "\4" . 'path'=>'路徑','block keyword' . "\4" . 'navigation'=>'導航','Breadcrumb'=>'面包屑導航','block title' . "\4" . 'Tax Switcher'=>'含稅切換','block description' . "\4" . 'Lets visitors see the prices with or without tax (VAT) – a switch, two buttons or a dropdown for the header or the shop. Every price of the store follows. Shows only when WooCommerce calculates taxes.'=>'讓訪客查看含稅或不含稅（增值稅）的價格——用於頁首或商店的開關、兩個按鈕或下拉清單。商店中的每個價格都會隨之變化。僅在 WooCommerce 計算稅費時顯示。','block keyword' . "\4" . 'tax'=>'稅','block keyword' . "\4" . 'vat'=>'增值稅','block keyword' . "\4" . 'prices'=>'價格','block keyword' . "\4" . 'incl'=>'含稅','block keyword' . "\4" . 'excl'=>'不含稅','block keyword' . "\4" . 'net'=>'淨價','block keyword' . "\4" . 'gross'=>'總價','block keyword' . "\4" . 'b2b'=>'b2b','block keyword' . "\4" . 'switch'=>'開關','block keyword' . "\4" . 'toggle'=>'切換','WooCommerce does not calculate taxes yet (or there is no tax rate), so the switch shows nothing on the site. Turn on taxes in WooCommerce › Settings › General and add the rates in WooCommerce › Settings › Tax.'=>'WooCommerce 尚未計算稅費（或沒有任何稅率），因此切換在網站上不顯示任何內容。請在「WooCommerce › 設定 › 常規」中啟用稅費，並在「WooCommerce › 設定 › 稅」中新增稅率。','Switching is off in Envo Blocks › Settings › Tax Switcher, so the switch shows nothing on the site.'=>'「Envo Blocks › 設定 › 含稅切換」中的切換已關閉，因此網站上不顯示任何內容。','block title' . "\4" . 'Trust Badges'=>'信任徽章','block description' . "\4" . 'Payment method icons and short guarantees (secure payment, returns, delivery) that build trust near the buy button or in the footer.'=>'付款方式圖示和簡短保障（安全付款、退貨、配送），可放在購買按鈕附近或頁尾中以建立信任。','block keyword' . "\4" . 'visa'=>'visa','block keyword' . "\4" . 'paypal'=>'paypal','block keyword' . "\4" . 'guarantee'=>'保障','Choose payment methods or add a guarantee in the block settings.'=>'請在區塊設定中選擇付款方式或新增保障。','Accepted payment methods'=>'支援的付款方式','block title' . "\4" . 'Video Popup'=>'影片彈窗','block description' . "\4" . 'A play button, or an image with a play button, that opens a YouTube, Vimeo, Dailymotion or own video in a pop-up window. Nothing is loaded from the video site before the click.'=>'播放按鈕，或帶播放按鈕的圖片，可在彈出視窗中打開 YouTube、Vimeo、Dailymotion 或自有影片。點選前不會從影片網站載入任何內容。','block keyword' . "\4" . 'lightbox'=>'燈箱','block keyword' . "\4" . 'youtube'=>'youtube','block keyword' . "\4" . 'vimeo'=>'vimeo','block keyword' . "\4" . 'play'=>'播放','Enter the address of a YouTube, Vimeo or Dailymotion video, or choose a video file, in the block settings.'=>'請在區塊設定中輸入 YouTube、Vimeo 或 Dailymotion 影片的地址，或選擇影片檔案。','This video address is not supported. Use a YouTube, Vimeo or Dailymotion link, or a link to an mp4 / webm file.'=>'不支援此影片地址。請使用 YouTube、Vimeo 或 Dailymotion 連結，或 mp4 / webm 檔案的連結。','Play video: %s'=>'播放影片：%s','Close video'=>'關閉影片','block title' . "\4" . 'Wishlist'=>'願望清單','block description' . "\4" . 'The visitor\'s wishlist for the wishlist page: products with price, stock, Add to cart and remove. A published page with this block becomes the wishlist page.'=>'用於願望清單頁面的訪客願望清單：帶價格、庫存、加入購物車和移除的產品。包含此區塊的已發布頁面將成為願望清單頁面。','block keyword' . "\4" . 'wishlist'=>'願望清單','block keyword' . "\4" . 'favorites'=>'收藏','block keyword' . "\4" . 'saved products'=>'已儲存的產品','block keyword' . "\4" . 'list'=>'清單','block title' . "\4" . 'Wishlist Button'=>'願望清單按鈕','block description' . "\4" . 'A heart that adds the product to the wishlist: on the product page, in a product template, or for a chosen product. Guests keep the list in the browser, customers in their account.'=>'將產品加入願望清單的愛心：用於產品頁面、產品範本或所選產品。訪客的清單儲存在瀏覽器中，顧客的儲存在帳戶中。','block keyword' . "\4" . 'favorite'=>'收藏','block keyword' . "\4" . 'heart'=>'愛心','block keyword' . "\4" . 'save for later'=>'稍後購買','block keyword' . "\4" . 'like'=>'喜歡','block style label' . "\4" . 'Default'=>'預設','block style label' . "\4" . 'On the image'=>'圖片上','Getting started'=>'入門','Installation'=>'安裝','First steps'=>'第一步','Import a template'=>'匯入範本','Header and footer of templates'=>'範本的頁首和頁尾','Export and import a page as a file'=>'將頁面匯出和匯入為檔案','Side cart'=>'側邊購物車','Checkout layouts'=>'結帳布局','Store Breadcrumbs'=>'商店面包屑','Shop Toolbar'=>'商店工具欄','Order Received'=>'訂單已收到','My Account'=>'我的帳戶','Shop blocks'=>'商店區塊','Features Bar'=>'優勢欄','Trust Badges'=>'信任徽章','Delivery Estimate'=>'送達預估','Coupon Code Box'=>'優惠碼框','Rating Summary'=>'評分摘要','Recently Viewed Products'=>'最近瀏覽的產品','Size Guide'=>'尺碼指南','Stock Indicator'=>'庫存指示器','Lowest Price'=>'最低價格','Order Tracking'=>'訂單追蹤','Payment QR Code'=>'Payment QR Code','Product Tabs'=>'產品分頁','Free Shipping Progress'=>'免運費進度','Wishlist Button'=>'願望清單按鈕','Content blocks'=>'內容區塊','Advanced Heading'=>'高級標題','Pricing Table'=>'價格表','Video Popup'=>'影片彈窗','Announcement Bar'=>'公告欄','Countdown'=>'倒計時','Opening Hours'=>'營業時間','Entrance animations'=>'入場動畫','Store features'=>'商店功能','PDF Invoices'=>'PDF 發票','Help'=>'幫助','Frequently asked questions'=>'常見問題','All documentation'=>'全部文件','Support forum on WordPress.org'=>'WordPress.org 支援論壇','Product blocks'=>'產品區塊','Products Carousel'=>'產品輪播','Slider / carousel of WooCommerce products using the default WooCommerce product look.'=>'使用 WooCommerce 預設產品外觀的 WooCommerce 產品滑桿 / 輪播。','Products Tabs'=>'產品分頁','Tabs with WooCommerce products: new, featured, on sale, best sellers or a category. Each tab shows a grid or a carousel.'=>'包含 WooCommerce 產品的分頁：新品、精選、促銷、暢銷或某個分類。每個分頁顯示網格或輪播。','Product List'=>'產品清單','A compact widget-like list of products in columns and rows: small image on the left, title, price and button next to it.'=>'按列和行排列的緊湊小工具式產品清單：左側是小圖片，旁邊是標題、價格和按鈕。','Product Mosaic'=>'產品馬賽克','WooCommerce products as image tiles in aligned mosaic layouts, with the title, description, price and button placed over the image.'=>'以對齊馬賽克布局的圖片圖塊顯示 WooCommerce 產品，標題、描述、價格和按鈕疊放在圖片上。','Product Split'=>'產品分屏','A selected WooCommerce product in two halves: title, short description, price and button on one side, the product image (or your own image) on the other.'=>'所選 WooCommerce 產品分成兩半：一側是標題、簡短描述、價格和按鈕，另一側是產品圖片（或您自己的圖片）。','Product Deal'=>'產品特惠','A product on sale with a countdown to the end of the offer and a stock progress bar.'=>'促銷產品，帶優惠結束倒計時和庫存進度條。','Product Showcase'=>'產品展示','One product at a time with a large image: a counter with a progress line, title, price, description, quantity with Add to cart and a link to the product. Up and down arrows slide to the next product.'=>'一次展示一個產品，配大圖：帶進度線的計數器、標題、價格、描述、帶加入購物車的數量和產品連結。上下箭頭切換到下一個產品。','Product Spotlight'=>'產品聚焦','Product carousel with the featured product\'s title, description, price and button on the left and the product images on the right: the active one in the middle, the others half hidden behind it. Full-width background, contained carousel.'=>'產品輪播，左側是精選產品的標題、描述、價格和按鈕，右側是產品圖片：當前圖片居中，其他圖片半隱藏在其後。全寬背景，輪播位於容器內。','Product Vertical Slider'=>'產品垂直滑桿','WooCommerce products that slide up and down, one at a time: product image with the title, description, price and button.'=>'一次一個上下滑動的 WooCommerce 產品：帶標題、描述、價格和按鈕的產品圖片。','Bestsellers Ranking'=>'暢銷排行','A numbered ranking of the best selling products with image, price, rating and number of sold units.'=>'暢銷產品的編號排行，帶圖片、價格、評分和已售數量。','Shop the Look'=>'買下這套造型','An image with pins. A pin opens a card of a WooCommerce product with price and add to cart.'=>'帶圖釘的圖片。圖釘會打開 WooCommerce 產品卡片，顯示價格和加入購物車。','Reviews Carousel'=>'評價輪播','Slider of customer reviews of your WooCommerce products: stars, text, author and product.'=>'您的 WooCommerce 產品的顧客評價滑桿：星級、內容、作者和產品。','Load More Products'=>'載入更多產品','A Load more button or infinite scroll instead of page numbers: the next products are added to the list without leaving the page. In a Product Collection, or for the shop pages from the settings.'=>'用「載入更多」按鈕或無限捲動代替頁碼：下一批產品會新增到清單中，無需離開頁面。可用於 Product Collection 中，或在設定中用於商店頁面。','Category and brand blocks'=>'分類和品牌區塊','Product Categories Carousel'=>'產品分類輪播','Slider / carousel of WooCommerce product categories using the default WooCommerce category look.'=>'使用 WooCommerce 預設分類外觀的 WooCommerce 產品分類滑桿 / 輪播。','Category Mosaic'=>'分類馬賽克','Product categories as image tiles in aligned mosaic layouts: equal tiles, two wide and four squares, large and small tiles, and more.'=>'以對齊馬賽克布局的圖片圖塊顯示產品分類：等大圖塊、兩寬四方、大小圖塊等。','Category Banners'=>'分類橫幅','Category tiles in mosaic layouts with a badge showing the best discount in the category ("Up to -40%") and a button.'=>'馬賽克布局的分類圖塊，帶顯示分類最大折扣的徽章（「最高 -40%」）和按鈕。','Category Split'=>'分類分屏','A WooCommerce category with its image and title on one side and products on the other side.'=>'一側是帶圖片和標題的 WooCommerce 分類，另一側是產品。','Category Showcase'=>'分類展示','A list of categories on one side and the products of the chosen category on the other, as tiles over their images.'=>'一側是分類清單，另一側是所選分類的產品，以圖塊形式疊放在圖片上。','Brands Carousel'=>'品牌輪播','A carousel of brand logos: WooCommerce brands or your own logos with links.'=>'品牌標誌輪播：WooCommerce 品牌或您自己的帶連結標誌。','Header and navigation'=>'頁首和導航','Mega Menu'=>'超級選單','A navigation menu whose items open large panels with any blocks: columns of links, images, buttons, products. Items can also show a panel of a product category. Accordion or side drawer on mobile.'=>'導航選單，其選單項可打開包含任意區塊的大面板：連結列、圖片、按鈕、產品。選單項還可以顯示產品分類面板。手機上為手風琴或側邊抽屜。','Category Mega Menu'=>'分類超級選單','A menu of your product categories with large panels of subcategories, images and a promo card. Horizontal bar or a vertical "All categories" menu; an accordion on mobile.'=>'您的產品分類選單，帶有包含子分類、圖片和促銷卡片的大面板。水平欄或垂直「所有分類」選單；手機上為手風琴。','Product Search (AJAX)'=>'產品搜尋（AJAX）','A product search field that shows matching products with image, title and price while typing, without loading a new page.'=>'輸入時顯示匹配產品（含圖片、標題和價格）的產品搜尋欄，無需載入新頁面。','Sticky Cart'=>'懸浮購物車','A cart icon with the number of items, e.g. in the header. When it scrolls out of view, a floating cart button appears in a corner of the screen; both open a cart drawer with the products, quantities, subtotal and the checkout.'=>'顯示商品數量的購物車圖示，例如在頁首中。滾出視野後，螢幕角落會出現懸浮購物車按鈕；兩者都會打開包含產品、數量、小計和結帳的購物車抽屜。','Off-Canvas Panel'=>'側滑面板','A button that opens a side panel with any blocks – a menu, product filters, contact details. Only on phones and tablets if you like; on wider screens the content then stays in the page.'=>'打開包含任意區塊（選單、產品篩選、聯繫方式）的側邊面板的按鈕。可設定為僅在手機和平板上使用；在更寬的螢幕上內容會直接顯示在頁面中。','Sticky Account'=>'懸浮帳戶','An account icon, e.g. in the header. When it scrolls out of view, a floating account button appears; both open a panel with the account menu, or a login form for guests. Stacks next to the Sticky Cart button instead of covering it.'=>'帳戶圖示，例如在頁首中。滾出視野後會出現懸浮帳戶按鈕；兩者都會打開包含帳戶選單或訪客登入表單的面板。會排在懸浮購物車按鈕旁邊，而不會遮住它。','Sticky Wishlist'=>'懸浮願望清單','A wishlist icon with the count, e.g. in the header. When it scrolls out of view, a floating button appears; both open a drawer with the saved products. With it on the page, the product images in lists get a heart. Builds on the free Wishlist blocks. Stacks next to the Sticky Cart and Sticky Account buttons.'=>'顯示數量的願望清單圖示，例如在頁首中。滾出視野後會出現懸浮按鈕；兩者都會打開包含已儲存產品的抽屜。頁面上有它時，清單中的產品圖片會顯示愛心。基於免費版的願望清單區塊。會排在懸浮購物車和懸浮帳戶按鈕旁邊。','Wishlist, compare and product page'=>'願望清單、對比和產品頁面','Compare Button'=>'對比按鈕','A Compare button for the product page or a product template: the product goes to the compare bar, and the visitor compares up to four products side by side.'=>'用於產品頁面或產品範本的對比按鈕：產品會進入對比欄，訪客最多可並排對比四個產品。','Compare Icon'=>'對比圖示','A compare icon with the number of products in the comparison, e.g. in the header. A click opens the comparison window. With it on the page, the product images in lists get compare buttons.'=>'顯示對比中產品數量的對比圖示，例如在頁首中。點選會打開對比視窗。頁面上有它時，清單中的產品圖片會顯示對比按鈕。','Comparison Table'=>'對比表','A product comparison table: chosen products with price, rating, availability, attributes and Add to cart, one of them highlighted – or the visitor\'s own comparison on a Compare page.'=>'產品對比表：所選產品的價格、評分、庫存狀態、屬性和加入購物車，其中一個突出顯示 – 或在對比頁面上顯示訪客自己的對比。','Variation Swatches'=>'變體樣本','Color, image or size swatches of a variable product for product templates (Product Collection): hovering a color shows that variation\'s image, a click opens the product with the value selected.'=>'用於產品範本（Product Collection）的可變產品顏色、圖片或尺碼樣本：懸停在顏色上會顯示該變體的圖片，點選會打開已選中該值的產品。','Variation Swatches Filter'=>'變體樣本篩選','Filter products by color, size or any attribute shown as swatches – in the shop and the categories, or anywhere else as a "shop by color" link list.'=>'按以樣本顯示的顏色、尺碼或任意屬性篩選產品 – 在商店和分類中，或在其他任何地方作為「按顏色購物」連結清單。','Product Gallery (Vertical)'=>'產品圖庫（垂直）','The product images with the thumbnails in a column next to the main image or in a row below: swipe, zoom, full screen and the image of the chosen color. Plus a small image gallery on the product cards of lists.'=>'產品圖片，縮圖在主圖旁的一列或下方的一行：滑動、縮放、全屏以及所選顏色的圖片。另外，清單中的產品卡片上還有小型圖庫。','Quick View'=>'快速查看','An eye button on the product images and a Quick View Button that open a window with the gallery, price, variations with swatches and Add to cart – without leaving the page.'=>'產品圖片上的眼睛按鈕和快速查看按鈕，可打開包含圖庫、價格、帶樣本的變體和加入購物車的視窗 – 無需離開頁面。','Product Badges'=>'產品徽章','Automatic labels on the product images – the discount in percent, Hot, Only 3 left, Sold out, New, Featured – and your own label per product. The block shows them on the product page.'=>'產品圖片上的自動標籤 – 折扣百分比、熱賣、僅剩 3 件、售罄、新品、精選 – 以及每個產品的自定義標籤。該區塊在產品頁面上顯示它們。','Sticky Add to Cart'=>'懸浮加入購物車','A bar with the product, its price and the Add to cart button that appears when the visitor scrolls past the product\'s own button. Place it in the single product template or on any page with a chosen product.'=>'當訪客捲動經過產品自身的按鈕時出現的欄，顯示產品、價格和加入購物車按鈕。可放在單個產品範本中或任何帶所選產品的頁面上。','Checkout Steps'=>'結帳步驟','The WooCommerce checkout in steps – details, shipping, payment – with a progress bar, Continue and Back buttons and a summary of the finished steps. For the Checkout block and the classic checkout.'=>'分步驟的 WooCommerce 結帳 – 詳情、配送、付款 – 帶進度條、繼續和返回按鈕以及已完成步驟的摘要。適用於 Checkout 區塊和經典結帳。','Popups'=>'彈窗','Popups with any blocks – a window, a slide-in, a bar or the full screen – after some seconds, after scrolling, when leaving, after adding to the cart or with a link. Site-wide popups with rules for pages, visitors and how often.'=>'包含任意區塊的彈窗 – 視窗、滑入、橫欄或全屏 – 在幾秒後、捲動後、離開時、加入購物車後或通過連結顯示。全站彈窗可設定頁面、訪客和頻率規則。','Sale Countdown Bar'=>'促銷倒計時欄','A bar with a sale message and a countdown to a date, a time every day or a day of the week, with a coupon code that copies with a click – above the header or floating at the bottom.'=>'帶促銷消息和倒計時（到某個日期、每天的某個時間或一週中的某天）的欄，附帶點選即可複製的優惠碼 – 位於頁首上方或懸浮在底部。','Frequently Bought Together'=>'經常一起購買','The product with 1–4 products that go with it, check boxes, the total price and one "Add all to cart" button.'=>'產品及其 1–4 個搭配產品、核取方塊、總價和一個「全部加入購物車」按鈕。','Cart Recommendations'=>'購物車推薦','Products to add from the side cart with one click: the cross-sells of the cart, best sellers, products on sale or the newest – a list, a scrolling row or two columns. For side cart layouts.'=>'可從側邊購物車一鍵新增的產品：購物車的交叉銷售、暢銷品、促銷產品或最新產品 – 清單、捲動行或兩列。用於側邊購物車布局。','Volume Pricing'=>'批量定價','Quantity discounts ("3+ pieces: 10 % off") set on the product, shown in a table where a click sets the quantity; the cart charges the lower price.'=>'在產品上設定的數量折扣（「3 件以上：9 折」），以表格顯示，點選即可設定數量；購物車按較低價格收費。','Product Add-Ons'=>'商品附加項','Extra fields before Add to cart – engraving, gift wrap, a protection plan, accessories, a photo to print – with a price for every choice that the cart really charges. On one product or for whole categories.'=>'在「加入購物車」之前新增額外欄位 – 刻字、禮品包裝、延長保修、配件、待列印的照片 – 每個選擇都有價格，購物車會真實計費。可用於單個商品或整個分類。','Deals & Offers'=>'優惠活動','Discount rules that run your promotions – buy 2 get 1 free, a free gift, a percent off a category, an amount off big orders, with dates and days – and a block that shows the running deals and what is missing.'=>'為您的促銷運行的折扣規則 – 買 2 送 1、免費贈品、分類百分比折扣、大額訂單立減，可設日期和星期 – 以及一個顯示進行中優惠和還差多少的區塊。','Quote Request'=>'詢價請求','Request a quote for catalog products: a quote list with quantities and a form; the request becomes an order you answer with prices and a payment link.'=>'為目錄商品詢價：帶數量的詢價清單和表單；詢價會變成一個訂單，您用價格和付款連結回覆。','Price History Chart'=>'價格歷史圖表','The price of a product in the last 30–365 days as a chart, with the current, lowest and highest price, from the real price history; follows the chosen variation.'=>'以圖表顯示產品最近 30–365 天的價格，包括當前價格、最低價格和最高價格，基於真實價格歷史；跟隨所選的變體。','Price Alert'=>'降價提醒','"Notify me when the price drops": visitors leave their e-mail and get one e-mail when the price of the product or the chosen variation goes down.'=>'「降價時通知我」：訪客留下電子郵件，當產品或所選變體降價時會收到一封郵件。','Back in Stock'=>'到貨通知','"Notify me when it is available": on a product that is out of stock visitors leave their e-mail and get one e-mail when it is in stock again – also for the chosen variation, with a list of the most wanted products.'=>'「有貨時通知我」：在缺貨產品上，訪客留下電子郵件，再次有貨時會收到一封郵件——也適用於所選變體，並提供最受期待產品清單。','Wholesale Prices'=>'批發價','Own prices for business customers – a wholesale price per product or a percent off the shop or a category, customer discounts and a form where customers apply for a wholesale account.'=>'為企業客戶設定專屬價格——依商品設定批發價，或對整個商店或某個分類打折，另有客戶折扣，以及客戶申請批發帳戶的表單。','Product Filters PRO & Filter Panel'=>'產品篩選 PRO 與篩選面板','The product filters without reloading the page, brand and "on sale" filters, swatches, buttons and dropdowns, and the Filter Panel: the filters in a drawer on phones with "Show N products".'=>'無需重新載入頁面的產品篩選、品牌和「促銷中」篩選、色板、按鈕和下拉清單，以及篩選面板：在手機上把篩選放進抽屜，並帶有「顯示 N 個產品」。','Motion Effects'=>'動態效果','Scrolling and mouse effects for any block: vertical and horizontal parallax, transparency, blur, rotate and scale while scrolling, a block that follows the mouse and a 3D tilt.'=>'適用於任意區塊的捲動和滑鼠效果：垂直和水平視差、透明度、模糊、捲動時旋轉和縮放、跟隨滑鼠的區塊以及 3D 傾斜。','Display Conditions'=>'顯示條件','Show or hide any block by rules: signed in or guest, user role, device, browser, date, days and time, URL parameter, the site the visitor came from, a cookie, new or returning visitor, the cart and the orders of the customer. Works on cached pages.'=>'按規則顯示或隱藏任意區塊：已登入或訪客、使用者角色、設備、瀏覽器、日期、星期和時間、URL 參數、訪客來源網站、Cookie、新訪客或回訪者、購物車和顧客的訂單。在快取頁面上也有效。','Content Slider'=>'內容滑桿','A slider where every slide has its own background and can hold any blocks. Full-width backgrounds with centered content.'=>'每張投影片都有自己的背景並可包含任意區塊的滑桿。全寬背景，內容居中。','Content Tabs'=>'內容分頁','Horizontal or vertical tabs; every tab holds any blocks.'=>'水平或垂直分頁；每個分頁可包含任意區塊。','Content Switcher'=>'內容切換器','A switch between two or more versions of content, e.g. annual and lifetime pricing. Every option holds any blocks.'=>'在兩個或多個內容版本之間切換，例如年付和終身定價。每個選項可包含任意區塊。','Before / After'=>'前 / 後對比','Two images on top of each other with a slider between them, to compare before and after.'=>'兩張疊放的圖片，中間有滑桿，用於對比前後效果。','Image with Background'=>'帶背景的圖片','A front image (ideally with a transparent background) over a background image or a decorative shape. The layers move slightly in space with the mouse.'=>'前景圖片（最好是透明背景）放在背景圖片或裝飾形狀上。圖層會隨滑鼠在空間中輕微移動。','Classic · Ivory'=>'經典 · 象牙白','Product page'=>'產品頁面','Classic · Sage'=>'經典 · 鼠尾草','Classic · Ocean'=>'經典 · 海洋','Shop page'=>'商店頁面','Classic · Mono'=>'經典 · 單色','Sidebar · Ivory'=>'側邊欄 · 象牙白','Sidebar · Ocean'=>'側邊欄 · 海洋','Sidebar · Sage'=>'側邊欄 · 鼠尾草','Essential · Ivory'=>'基礎 · 象牙白','Essential · Ocean'=>'基礎 · 海洋','Essential · Sage'=>'基礎 · 鼠尾草','Compact · Mono'=>'緊湊 · 單色','Compact · Coral'=>'緊湊 · 珊瑚','Compact · Violet'=>'緊湊 · 紫羅蘭','Night · Noir'=>'夜色 · 黑','Night · Midnight'=>'夜色 · 午夜','Night · Forest'=>'夜色 · 森林','Express · Ivory'=>'Express · 象牙','Express · Ocean'=>'Express · 海洋','Express · Sage'=>'快捷 · 鼠尾草','Classic · Coral'=>'Classic · 珊瑚','Classic · Violet'=>'Classic · 紫羅蘭','Focus · Noir'=>'Focus · 黑','Focus · Midnight'=>'Focus · 午夜','Focus · Forest'=>'Focus · 森林','Automatic threshold'=>'自動門檻','Free Shipping Bar'=>'免運費欄','Manual threshold, own messages'=>'手動門檻，自定義消息','Left aligned, no bar, tinted'=>'左對齊，無進度條，淺色','Violet, thick bar'=>'紫色，粗進度條','Dark, right aligned'=>'深色，右對齊','Hides when reached'=>'達到後隱藏','Thin mint line'=>'細薄荷線','Icons on top in violet circles'=>'頂部圖示位於紫色圓圈中','Dark strip, three items'=>'深色條，三項','Left aligned, no dividers'=>'左對齊，無分隔線','With heading and more methods'=>'帶標題和更多方式','Monochrome in a box'=>'框中的單色','Only guarantees'=>'僅保障','Only payment methods, large'=>'僅付款方式，大號','Later cut-off with seconds'=>'較晚截止，帶秒數','Plain text, own messages'=>'純文字，自定義消息','Line style, Saturday shipping'=>'線條樣式，週六發貨','Default link'=>'預設連結','Violet button'=>'紫色按鈕','Outline button, dark window'=>'描邊按鈕，深色視窗','Link without icon, aligned right'=>'無圖示連結，右對齊','Ticket with apply button'=>'帶應用按鈕的票券','Filled violet, stacked'=>'紫色填充，堆疊','Solid, free shipping'=>'實色，免運費','Whole shop'=>'整個商店','One product, stacked'=>'單個產品，堆疊','Violet, thick bars'=>'紫色，粗條形','With rating and button'=>'帶評分和按鈕','Six small cards'=>'六張小卡片','On the product page'=>'在產品頁面上','Three styles'=>'三種樣式','Brand colors'=>'品牌顏色','The wishlist page: cards'=>'願望清單頁面：卡片','Rows, removed after adding to the cart'=>'行，加入購物車後移除','Monthly or yearly in euros'=>'按月或按年，以歐元計','Dark cards'=>'深色卡片','One-time payment, left aligned'=>'一次性付款，左對齊','Four plans with a custom price'=>'四個方案，自定義價格','One plan, launch offer'=>'一個方案，上新優惠','Currency after the price'=>'貨幣在價格後','Soft pastel cards'=>'柔和粉彩卡片','Shipping options without buttons'=>'不帶按鈕的配送選項','Every plan discounted'=>'每個方案都有折扣','Typing with a marker highlight'=>'打字配熒光筆高亮','Stacked, flip and underline'=>'堆疊，翻轉和下劃線','Parts with bac