>'運動器材商店：首頁以及「關於我們」、「幫助」、「聯繫我們」頁面。','Business consulting firm: services, a four-step method, results in numbers, the partners, engagement packages and a short reading list you can buy – works without WooCommerce too (the shop parts are skipped): a homepage and the pages Services, About, Contact.'=>'商業咨詢公司：服務、四步方法、數字化成果、合夥人、合作套餐和可購買的簡短書單——沒有 WooCommerce 也能使用（會跳過商店部分）：首頁以及服務、關於我們、聯繫我們頁面。','Café and bakery: today\'s menu, opening hours that say if you are open now, events, the room on a map and coffee to take home – works without WooCommerce too (the shop parts are skipped): a homepage and the pages Menu, Events, Visit.'=>'咖啡館與烘焙坊：今日選單、顯示當前是否營業的營業時間、活動、地圖上的店面和外帶咖啡——沒有 WooCommerce 也能使用（會跳過商店部分）：首頁以及選單、活動、到店頁面。','Visit'=>'到店','Interior design studio: services, selected projects, a three-step process, consultation packages and objects from the studio shop – works without WooCommerce too (the shop parts are skipped): a homepage and the pages Projects, Services, Contact.'=>'室內設計工作室：服務、精選項目、三步流程、咨詢套餐和工作室商店的物品——沒有 WooCommerce 也能使用（會跳過商店部分）：首頁以及項目、服務、聯繫我們頁面。','Projects'=>'項目','A wizard builds your whole store from a template in your brand colour – pages with your products, header, footer, logo and colours. Envo Blocks › Store in 5 minutes.'=>'精靈會用您品牌色的範本建立整個商店 – 包含您商品的頁面、頁首、頁尾、標誌和顏色。Envo Blocks › 5 分鐘開店。','Envo Blocks Store theme'=>'Envo Blocks Store 主題','Install and activate our free theme from WordPress.org right in Templates Import.'=>'在 Templates Import 中直接從 WordPress.org 安裝並啟用我們的免費主題。','An image or video background that moves slower than the page or zooms while scrolling, with any blocks on top.'=>'捲動時比頁面移動得更慢或逐漸放大的圖片或影片背景，上面可放置任意區塊。','Forms of Contact Form 7, WPForms, Fluent Forms and other form plugins in the look of your store.'=>'讓 Contact Form 7、WPForms、Fluent Forms 等表單外掛的表單符合您商店的外觀。','The languages of WPML, Polylang or TranslatePress in your header or footer.'=>'在頁首或頁尾中顯示 WPML、Polylang 或 TranslatePress 的語言。','New templates without updates'=>'無需更新的新範本','Templates Import loads new free templates from our library as soon as they are published.'=>'Templates Import 會在新的免費範本發布後立即從我們的範本庫中載入。','Classic themes: templates and store layouts keep their width, and small block images stay small in Twenty Twenty-One.'=>'經典主題：範本和商店布局保持原有寬度，區塊中的小圖片在 Twenty Twenty-One 中也保持小尺寸。','Welcome'=>'歡迎','Blocks'=>'區塊','Guides'=>'指南','Settings'=>'設定','Envo Blocks PRO'=>'Envo Blocks PRO','Get PRO'=>'獲取 PRO','Sales'=>'銷售','More'=>'更多','Block settings'=>'區塊設定','Discount Rules'=>'折扣規則','Abandoned Carts'=>'棄置購物車','Loyalty Points'=>'積分','There are no settings yet.'=>'暫無設定。','Envo Blocks Settings'=>'Envo Blocks 設定','WooCommerce is needed'=>'需要 WooCommerce','WooCommerce is installed but not active'=>'WooCommerce 已安裝但未啟用','WooCommerce is not installed'=>'WooCommerce 未安裝','Checkout Fields, Payment QR Code, Invoices, Store Layouts and the blocks marked WooCommerce need an active WooCommerce. They appear in the Envo Blocks menu and in the block inserter as soon as it is active. The templates, sections, presets and the other blocks work without it.'=>'Checkout Fields、Payment QR Code、發票、Store Layouts 以及標有 WooCommerce 的區塊需要啟用 WooCommerce。啟用後，它們會立即出現在 Envo Blocks 選單和區塊插入器中。範本、區段、預設和其他區塊無需它即可使用。','Activate WooCommerce'=>'啟用 WooCommerce','Install and activate WooCommerce'=>'安裝並啟用 WooCommerce','Ask the administrator of the site to install and activate WooCommerce.'=>'請網站管理員安裝並啟用 WooCommerce。','About WooCommerce'=>'關於 WooCommerce','Envo Blocks:'=>'Envo Blocks：','Checkout Fields, Payment QR Code, Invoices, Store Layouts and the WooCommerce blocks need an active WooCommerce.'=>'Checkout Fields、Payment QR Code、發票、Store Layouts 和 WooCommerce 區塊需要啟用 WooCommerce。','Envo Blocks – Store Templates, Blocks & Layouts for WooCommerce'=>'Envo Blocks – 適用於 WooCommerce 的商店範本、區塊和布局','Version %s'=>'版本 %s','Envo Blocks pages'=>'Envo Blocks 頁面','Envo Blocks PRO blocks'=>'Envo Blocks PRO 區塊','More WooCommerce and content blocks in Envo Blocks PRO:'=>'Envo Blocks PRO 中的更多 WooCommerce 和內容區塊：','All PRO blocks with guides and demos'=>'所有 PRO 區塊及指南和展示','%d more blocks for your store'=>'為您的商店再添 %d 個區塊','Product carousels, mega menus, wishlist, compare, variation swatches, sticky cart and premium templates.'=>'產品輪播、超級選單、願望清單、對比、變體樣本、懸浮購物車和高級範本。','See what is in PRO'=>'查看 PRO 包含的內容','Build store pages in minutes'=>'幾分鐘內搭建商店頁面','Import a ready-made page, drop in single sections or ready-made block presets, and add WooCommerce blocks that help you sell: trust badges, coupons, delivery estimates and more.'=>'匯入現成的頁面，放入單個區段或現成的區塊預設，並新增幫助您銷售的 WooCommerce 區塊：信任徽章、優惠券、送達預估等。','Create a page'=>'建立頁面','View live demos'=>'查看線上展示','Page sections'=>'頁面區段','Get started in three steps'=>'三步開始','Open a page in the editor'=>'在編輯器中打開頁面','Create a new page or edit an existing one.'=>'建立新頁面或編輯現有頁面。','Click "Templates Import" in the toolbar'=>'點選工具欄中的「Templates Import」','Choose Templates for a whole page, Sections for one part of a page or Presets for a ready-made block.'=>'整頁選擇「範本」，頁面的一部分選擇「區段」，現成區塊選擇「預設」。','Import and make it yours'=>'匯入並打造成您自己的','Change texts, colors and images. Products and categories come from your own store.'=>'更改文字、顏色和圖片。產品和分類來自您自己的商店。','How to import a template'=>'如何匯入範本','Blocks in the Envo Blocks section of the inserter'=>'插入器中 Envo Blocks 分組下的區塊','All blocks with guides and demos'=>'所有區塊及指南和展示','Need help?'=>'需要幫助？','Support forum'=>'支援論壇','Do you like Envo Blocks?'=>'喜歡 Envo Blocks 嗎？','A short review on WordPress.org helps other store owners find the plugin.'=>'在 WordPress.org 上留下簡短評價可以幫助其他店主找到這個外掛。','You cannot create posts or pages, or the block editor is turned off for them.'=>'您無法建立文章或頁面，或者它們的區塊編輯器已關閉。','Here you import whole templates into a new page or post. Page sections and presets are inserted right where you edit: open a page or post, click "Templates Import" in the toolbar and switch to Sections or Presets.'=>'在這裡將完整範本匯入新的頁面或文章。頁面區段和預設會插入到您正在編輯的位置：打開頁面或文章，點選工具欄中的「Templates Import」，然後切換到「區段」或「預設」。','Open a new page'=>'打開新頁面','Loading templates…'=>'正在載入範本…','The template library needs JavaScript.'=>'範本庫需要 JavaScript。','Find them in the Envo Blocks section of the block inserter. Each block has a guide and a live demo with ready-made variants.'=>'可在區塊插入器的 Envo Blocks 分組中找到它們。每個區塊都有指南和帶現成變體的線上展示。','Guide'=>'指南','Find them in the Envo Blocks PRO section of the block inserter.'=>'可在區塊插入器的 Envo Blocks PRO 分組中找到它們。','Find them in the Envo Blocks PRO section of the block inserter. Without an active license they are shown on your pages but cannot be edited.'=>'可在區塊插入器的 Envo Blocks PRO 分組中找到它們。沒有有效授權時，它們會顯示在您的頁面上，但無法編輯。','These blocks come with Envo Blocks PRO. Open a guide or a live demo to see what they do.'=>'這些區塊隨 Envo Blocks PRO 提供。打開指南或線上展示了解它們的功能。','Step-by-step guides with pictures. They open on envoblocks.com in a new tab.'=>'帶圖片的分步指南。它們會在新標籤頁中的 envoblocks.com 上打開。','PRO: %s'=>'PRO：%s','Install Envo Blocks PRO'=>'安裝 Envo Blocks PRO','Activate the license key'=>'啟用授權金鑰','Import a premium template'=>'匯入高級範本','All PRO documentation'=>'全部 PRO 文件','Envo Blocks PRO is active'=>'Envo Blocks PRO 已啟用','Thank you! All PRO blocks, premium templates and premium page sections are ready to use.'=>'謝謝！所有 PRO 區塊、高級範本和高級頁面區段均可使用。','PRO settings'=>'PRO 設定','PRO documentation'=>'PRO 文件','Everything for a complete store: %d more blocks and premium templates'=>'打造完整商店所需的一切：再添 %d 個區塊和高級範本','Envo Blocks PRO adds product and category carousels, mega menus, AJAX search, wishlist, compare, variation swatches, sticky cart and more, plus premium templates and page sections from our demos.'=>'Envo Blocks PRO 增加了產品和分類輪播、超級選單、AJAX 搜尋、願望清單、對比、變體樣本、懸浮購物車等，以及來自我們展示的高級範本和頁面區段。','%d WooCommerce and content blocks'=>'%d 個 WooCommerce 和內容區塊','Premium templates and page sections'=>'高級範本和頁面區段','Live demos of every block and template'=>'每個區塊和範本的線上展示','Updates and support'=>'更新和支援','Premium page sections'=>'高級頁面區段','Insert them from the Sections tab of the template window. Click a picture to see it in its live demo.'=>'從範本視窗的「區段」分頁中插入它們。點選圖片可在其線上展示中查看。','PRO blocks'=>'PRO 區塊','Ready to build a better store?'=>'準備好打造更好的商店了嗎？','Yearly and lifetime plans for 3 to 100 sites.'=>'適用於 3 到 100 個網站的年付和終身方案。','See plans and pricing'=>'查看方案和價格','Secure payment'=>'安全付款','30-day returns'=>'30 天退貨','Fast delivery'=>'快速配送','Starter'=>'Starter','For small shops that are just starting.'=>'適合剛起步的小商店。','1 online store'=>'1 個網路商店','100 products'=>'100 個產品','Email support'=>'郵件支援','Custom domain'=>'自定義域名','Advanced reports'=>'高級報告','Professional'=>'Professional','Everything a growing shop needs.'=>'成長中的商店所需的一切。','Billed yearly'=>'按年計費','Most popular'=>'最受歡迎','3 online stores'=>'3 個網路商店','Unlimited products'=>'無限產品','Priority support'=>'優先支援','Choose Professional'=>'選擇 Professional','Business'=>'Business','For teams and larger catalogues.'=>'適合團隊和較大的產品目錄。','Unlimited stores'=>'無限商店','24/7 phone support'=>'24/7 電話支援','Contact sales'=>'聯繫銷售','We build'=>'我們打造','online stores'=>'網路商店','websites'=>'網站','brands'=>'品牌','that sell.'=>'帶來銷量。','Free shipping on orders over $50'=>'訂單滿 $50 免運費','30-day returns, no questions asked'=>'30 天退貨，無需理由','New season – shop the collection'=>'新季上新 – 選購系列','On qualifying orders'=>'適用於符合條件的訂單','Easy returns'=>'輕鬆退貨','30 days to change your mind'=>'30 天內可改變主意','Friendly support'=>'友好的客服','We are here to help'=>'我們隨時為您提供幫助','100% protected checkout'=>'100% 安全結帳','Bank transfer'=>'銀行轉帳','Envo Blocks Canvas (no header and footer)'=>'Envo Blocks Canvas（無頁首和頁尾）','Only the content of the page, without the header and footer of the theme. For pages that have their own header and footer, such as the Envo Blocks templates.'=>'僅頁面內容，不含主題的頁首和頁尾。適用於有自己頁首和頁尾的頁面，例如 Envo Blocks 範本。','Log in to see prices'=>'登入後查看價格','Log in to buy'=>'登入後購買','Catalog mode'=>'目錄模式','Products without prices and without Add to cart are set in %s.'=>'無價格、無「加入購物車」的商品在 %s 中設定。','Envo Blocks › Catalog Mode'=>'Envo Blocks › 目錄模式','Catalog Mode'=>'目錄模式','No button'=>'無按鈕','A link (e.g. Contact us)'=>'連結（例如聯繫我們）','Log in (for visitors who are not signed in)'=>'登入（面向未登入的訪客）','The settings were saved.'=>'設定已儲存。','Show products without prices and without Add to cart – for everyone, or only for visitors who are not signed in (wholesale, B2B, "ask for a price"). A button of your choice takes the place of Add to cart.'=>'顯示商品但不顯示價格和「加入購物車」 – 面向所有人，或僅面向未登入訪客（批發、B2B、「價格面议」）。由您選擇的按鈕代替「加入購物車」。','Off'=>'關閉','For visitors who are not signed in'=>'面向未登入訪客','For everyone'=>'面向所有人','Only these categories'=>'僅限這些分類','All products'=>'所有產品','Empty = all products. Subcategories count.'=>'留空 = 所有商品。包含子分類。','Hide the prices'=>'隱藏價格','Show the prices (only no Add to cart)'=>'顯示價格（僅隱藏「加入購物車」）','Text instead of the price'=>'替代價格的文字','Empty: "Log in to see prices" for visitors who are not signed in, nothing for everyone.'=>'留空：對未登入訪客顯示「登入後查看價格」，對所有人不顯示。','Button instead of Add to cart'=>'替代「加入購物車」的按鈕','"Request a quote" with a quote list comes with Envo Blocks PRO.'=>'帶詢價清單的「詢價」包含在 Envo Blocks PRO 中。','Link of the button'=>'按鈕連結','For the link button, e.g. your contact page. Empty = the product page.'=>'用於連結按鈕，例如您的聯繫頁面。留空 = 商品頁面。','Sorry, you are not allowed to change these settings.'=>'抱歉，您無權更改這些設定。','Company name'=>'公司名稱','%s (optional)'=>'%s（可選）','Select an option…'=>'選擇一個選項…','Checkout Fields'=>'Checkout Fields','Sorry, you are not allowed to change the checkout fields.'=>'抱歉，您無權更改結帳欄位。','Checkbox'=>'核取方塊','Address (billing and shipping)'=>'地址（帳單和收貨）','Order (additional information)'=>'訂單（附加資訊）','The checkout fields were saved.'=>'結帳欄位已儲存。','The checkout fields are back to the settings of WooCommerce.'=>'結帳欄位已恢復為 WooCommerce 的設定。','Address fields'=>'地址欄位','The billing and shipping address of the checkout (block checkout and classic checkout). Drag the rows to change the order. Some countries have their own rules (for example no postcode or state); a field you hide or make optional stays so in every country.'=>'結帳中的帳單和收貨地址（區塊結帳和經典結帳）。拖動行可更改順序。某些國家/地區有自己的規則（例如沒有郵編或省/州）；您隱藏或設為可選的欄位在所有國家/地區都保持這樣。','Field'=>'欄位','Required'=>'必填','Drag to change the order'=>'拖動以更改順序','Label of %s'=>'%s 的標籤','Show %s'=>'顯示 %s','Needed for shipping and taxes'=>'配送和稅費所需','%s is required'=>'%s 為必填項','Additional fields'=>'附加欄位','Own fields of the checkout. The answers are saved with the order and shown in the order screen, in the order e-mails and in My account. Contact fields are shown under the e-mail address, address fields in both addresses, order fields under "Additional information".'=>'結帳的自定義欄位。答案隨訂單儲存，並顯示在訂單頁面、訂單郵件和我的帳戶中。聯繫欄位顯示在電子郵件地址下方，地址欄位顯示在兩個地址中，訂單欄位顯示在「附加資訊」下方。','Type'=>'類型','Options (select)'=>'選項（下拉選擇）','No additional fields yet.'=>'還沒有附加欄位。','Add field'=>'新增欄位','Go back to the checkout fields of WooCommerce? Your changes and additional fields are removed (answers already saved with orders stay).'=>'恢復為 WooCommerce 的結帳欄位？您的更改和附加欄位將被刪除（已隨訂單儲存的答案會保留）。','Reset to WooCommerce'=>'重置為 WooCommerce','e.g. VAT number'=>'例如 增值稅號','One option per line'=>'每行一個選項','Options, one per line'=>'選項，每行一個','Default template'=>'預設範本','The file could not be uploaded. It may be larger than your server allows.'=>'無法上傳檔案。檔案可能超過了伺服器允許的大小。','Imported page'=>'匯入的頁面','The uploaded file is no longer available. Please upload it again.'=>'上傳的檔案已不可用。請重新上傳。','Template file is too large.'=>'範本檔案太大。','Your server cannot open ZIP files (the PHP zip extension is missing). Upload the JSON file instead.'=>'您的伺服器無法打開 ZIP 檔案（缺少 PHP zip 擴充）。請改為上傳 JSON 檔案。','The ZIP file could not be opened.'=>'無法打開 ZIP 檔案。','The ZIP file does not contain a template (template.json).'=>'ZIP 檔案不包含範本（template.json）。','Your server cannot create ZIP files (the PHP zip extension is missing). Use Export as JSON instead.'=>'您的伺服器無法建立 ZIP 檔案（缺少 PHP zip 擴充）。請改用「匯出為 JSON」。','The ZIP file could not be created.'=>'無法建立 ZIP 檔案。','This filter needs Envo Blocks PRO.'=>'此篩選器需要 Envo Blocks PRO。','Availability'=>'庫存狀態','Offers'=>'優惠','Create a product attribute first (Products › Attributes).'=>'請先建立產品屬性（產品 › 屬性）。','Any'=>'任意','Show less'=>'收起','Show more'=>'顯示更多','Rated %d star'=>'評分 %d 星','Highest price'=>'最高價格','up to %s'=>'最高 %s','from %s'=>'%s 起','%s stars'=>'%s 星','Blue'=>'藍色','Remove filter: %s'=>'移除篩選：%s','Form #%d'=>'表單 #%d','This plugin is not used by any template.'=>'沒有範本使用此外掛。','The plugin was downloaded but could not be found.'=>'外掛已下載但找不到。','This theme is not recommended by any template.'=>'沒有範本推薦此主題。','This theme cannot be activated on this site.'=>'無法在此網站上啟用此主題。','WordPress cannot install files on this server without FTP details. Please install it in Plugins > Add New (or Appearance > Themes).'=>'沒有 FTP 資訊，WordPress 無法在此伺服器上安裝檔案。請在 外掛 > 新增新外掛（或 外觀 > 主題）中安裝。','The installation failed.'=>'安裝失敗。','You are not allowed to do this.'=>'您無權執行此操作。','Every single product page.'=>'每個單個產品頁面。','The shop, product categories, tags, brands and product search.'=>'商店、產品分類、標籤、品牌和產品搜尋。','The cart page, also when the cart is empty.'=>'購物車頁面，包括購物車為空時。','The thank-you page after an order.'=>'下單後的感謝頁面。','My account with all its sections, and the login form.'=>'我的帳戶的所有部分以及登入表單。','The checkout page (not the order received and order payment pages). The WooCommerce checkout itself stays: payments, shipping and coupons work as before.'=>'結帳頁面（不包括訂單已收到頁面和訂單付款頁面）。WooCommerce 結帳本身保持不變：付款、配送和優惠券照常工作。','The cart panel that slides in from the side of every page (Mini-Cart, Sticky Cart, after Add to cart).'=>'在每個頁面從側邊滑入的購物車面板（Mini-Cart、Sticky Cart、加入購物車後）。','Store Layout'=>'商店布局','Add Layout'=>'新增布局','Add Store Layout'=>'新增商店布局','Edit Store Layout'=>'編輯商店布局','New Store Layout'=>'新建商店布局','Search Store Layouts'=>'搜尋商店布局','No store layouts yet.'=>'還沒有商店布局。','No store layouts in the trash.'=>'回收站中沒有商店布局。','Layout published: it is used on the store pages now.'=>'布局已發布：現在已用於商店頁面。','Layout updated.'=>'布局已更新。','There is no store page to show this layout on yet (for example no product or no order).'=>'還沒有可顯示此布局的商店頁面（例如沒有產品或訂單）。','This layout is included in Envo Blocks PRO.'=>'此布局包含在 Envo Blocks PRO 中。','PRO layouts are not available. Make sure the PRO plugin is active and its license is active.'=>'PRO 布局不可用。請確認 PRO 外掛已啟用且其授權有效。','Template file was not found.'=>'未找到範本檔案。','The layout file is not valid.'=>'布局檔案無效。','Layout not found.'=>'未找到布局。','Store layouts need WooCommerce.'=>'商店布局需要 WooCommerce。','Store layouts change the product page, the shop, the cart, the order received page and My account in any theme: the theme header and footer stay, the part between them comes from the layout. Start from a ready-made design below or with an empty layout, edit it with blocks and publish it. A published layout is used at once; a draft is not.'=>'商店布局可在任何主題中更改產品頁面、商店、購物車、訂單已收到頁面和我的帳戶：主題的頁首和頁尾保持不變，中間部分來自布局。從下方的現成設計或空白布局開始，用區塊編輯並發布。已發布的布局會立即使用；草稿則不會。','Read the guide'=>'閱讀指南','Your store layouts'=>'您的商店布局','All layouts are turned off: the store shows the theme pages.'=>'所有布局已關閉：商店顯示主題頁面。','Turn layouts on'=>'開啟布局','The store shows the theme pages until you turn them on again. Nothing is deleted.'=>'在您重新開啟之前，商店顯示主題頁面。不會刪除任何內容。','Turn all layouts off'=>'關閉所有布局','Page'=>'頁面','Shown on'=>'顯示於','The theme page (no layout).'=>'主題頁面（無布局）。','Empty layout'=>'空白布局','(no title)'=>'（無標題）','Draft – not used'=>'草稿 – 未使用','Published – all layouts are off'=>'已發布 – 所有布局已關閉','Not used: its rules need Envo Blocks PRO'=>'未使用：其規則需要 Envo Blocks PRO','Not used: "%s" comes first'=>'未使用：「%s」優先','Stop using'=>'停止使用','Use it'=>'使用','Trash'=>'回收站','Loading layouts…'=>'正在載入布局…','Theme template in the Site Editor'=>'站點編輯器中的主題範本','Every %s'=>'每個%s','The shop, all categories and product searches'=>'商店、所有分類和產品搜尋','Every page except the cart and the checkout'=>'除購物車和結帳外的所有頁面','The layout is used on the store pages now.'=>'布局現在已用於商店頁面。','The layout is a draft now and not used.'=>'布局現為草稿，未使用。','All layouts are turned off.'=>'所有布局已關閉。','Layouts are turned on.'=>'布局已開啟。','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'抱歉，您無權執行此操作。','Layout settings'=>'布局設定','Choose…'=>'選擇…','Published = used on these pages, draft = not used. The theme header and footer stay.'=>'已發布 = 用於這些頁面，草稿 = 未使用。主題的頁首和頁尾保持不變。','All pages of this kind.'=>'此類型的所有頁面。','With Envo Blocks PRO a layout can be shown only for some categories, tags or products.'=>'使用 Envo Blocks PRO 時，布局可以只對某些分類、標籤或產品顯示。','Distraction-free checkout'=>'無幹擾結帳','Without the header and the footer of the theme (no menu): add the Checkout Header block for the logo, a secure checkout note and a link back to the cart.'=>'不顯示主題的頁首和頁尾（無選單）：新增結帳頁首區塊以顯示標誌、安全結帳提示和返回購物車連結。','Product of the preview'=>'預覽的產品','Automatic'=>'自動','The editor and the preview show this product. Save and reload the editor after a change.'=>'編輯器和預覽顯示此產品。更改後請儲存並重新載入編輯器。','Accent (buttons, highlights)'=>'强調色（按鈕、高亮）','Text on the accent'=>'强調色上的文字','Page background'=>'頁面背景','Boxes and cards'=>'框和卡片','Secondary text'=>'次要文字','Ivory'=>'象牙白','Sage'=>'鼠尾草','Ocean'=>'海洋','Coral'=>'珊瑚','Violet'=>'紫羅蘭','Sand'=>'沙色','Blush'=>'腮紅粉','Sun'=>'陽光','Mono'=>'單色','Noir (dark)'=>'黑（深色）','Midnight (dark)'=>'午夜（深色）','Forest (dark)'=>'森林（深色）','Colours'=>'顏色','This layout uses no palette of the designs: change its colours in the blocks.'=>'此布局未使用設計的調色板：請在區塊中更改其顏色。','Own colours'=>'自定義顏色','Save the layout to recolour it: the sections, the buttons, prices and fields of WooCommerce. A changed colour picks "Own colours".'=>'儲存布局以重新著色：區段、按鈕、價格和 WooCommerce 的欄位。更改顏色後會選中「自定義顏色」。','PRO templates are not available. Make sure the PRO plugin is active and its license is active.'=>'PRO 範本不可用。請確認 PRO 外掛已啟用且其授權有效。','Store layouts are used from Envo Blocks › Store Layouts.'=>'商店布局在 Envo Blocks › Store Layouts 中使用。','Template file is not valid JSON.'=>'範本檔案不是有效的 JSON。','Template file has an unsupported format.'=>'範本檔案格式不受支援。','Template structure is invalid.'=>'範本結構無效。','Template contains too many blocks.'=>'範本包含的區塊過多。','Template contains an invalid block.'=>'範本包含無效的區塊。','Template uses a block that is not available on this site.'=>'範本使用了此網站上不可用的區塊。','Template contains invalid block attributes.'=>'範本包含無效的區塊屬性。','Template contains an invalid number.'=>'範本包含無效的數字。','Template contains a value that is too long.'=>'範本包含過長的值。','Template contains an unsafe URL.'=>'範本包含不安全的 URL。','Template structure is too complex.'=>'範本結構過於複雜。','Template contains an invalid attribute name.'=>'範本包含無效的屬性名稱。','Template contains an unsupported value.'=>'範本包含不受支援的值。','What’s new in Envo Blocks %s'=>'Envo Blocks %s 的新功能','Fixed:'=>'已修複：','See the blocks'=>'查看區塊','Full changelog'=>'完整更新日誌','%d new store template'=>'%d 個新的商店範本','complete stores you can import in Templates Import.'=>'可在 Templates Import 中匯入的完整商店。','+%d more'=>'還有 %d 個','See the new templates'=>'查看新範本','Direct bank transfer is not enabled: the QR code shows only for orders paid this way.'=>'直接銀行轉帳未啟用：QR 碼僅對以此方式付款的訂單顯示。','Payment settings'=>'付款設定','A QR code for the banking app of the customer, for orders paid by direct bank transfer that wait for the payment: QR Platba (SPD) for CZK and EPC QR (SEPA, "GiroCode") for EUR. The customer scans it and gets the account, amount and reference filled in. Add the Payment QR Code block to the Order Confirmation template; the customer e-mails get the code too. It does not confirm payments.'=>'為等待付款的直接銀行轉帳訂單提供顧客銀行應用使用的QR 碼：CZK 使用 QR Platba（SPD），EUR 使用 EPC QR（SEPA，「GiroCode」）。顧客掃描後，帳戶、金額和參考號會自動填寫。請將 Payment QR Code 區塊新增到訂單確認範本；顧客郵件中也會包含此碼。它不會確認付款。','QR code in e-mails'=>'郵件中的QR 碼','Add the code to the customer e-mails of orders waiting for the bank transfer'=>'在等待銀行轉帳的訂單的顧客郵件中新增此碼','The first account with an IBAN'=>'第一個帶 IBAN 的帳戶','The accounts with a valid IBAN from the Direct bank transfer settings of WooCommerce.'=>'WooCommerce 直接銀行轉帳設定中帶有效 IBAN 的帳戶。','No account with a valid IBAN yet: add the IBAN (and BIC) of your account to the Direct bank transfer settings of WooCommerce.'=>'還沒有帶有效 IBAN 的帳戶：請在 WooCommerce 的直接銀行轉帳設定中新增帳戶的 IBAN（和 BIC）。','Bank accounts'=>'銀行帳戶','Placeholders: {order_number}, {order_id}, {site_title}. The digits of the order number are also the variable symbol (QR Platba).'=>'預留位置：{order_number}、{order_id}、{site_title}。訂單號的數字也是可變符號（QR Platba）。','Sample'=>'示例','The code of a sample order with these settings. Try it with your banking app, without sending the payment.'=>'使用這些設定生成的示例訂單QR 碼。可用您的銀行應用試掃，無需發送付款。','Pay by bank transfer'=>'銀行轉帳付款','Scan the code with the app of your bank: the payment details are filled in.'=>'用您銀行的應用掃描此碼：付款詳情會自動填寫。','Account name'=>'帳戶名','IBAN'=>'IBAN','BIC / SWIFT'=>'BIC / SWIFT','Amount'=>'金額','Variable symbol'=>'可變符號','Message'=>'附言','Envo Blocks preview: %s'=>'Envo Blocks 預覽：%s','Lowest price before a discount'=>'折扣前最低價格','The lowest price of the days before a discount (EU Omnibus rule) is set in %s.'=>'折扣前幾天的最低價格（歐盟 Omnibus 規定）在 %s 中設定。','Envo Blocks › Lowest Price'=>'Envo Blocks › 最低價格','In the EU a discount must show the lowest price of the 30 days before it (Omnibus directive). Envo Blocks keeps the price changes of your products and variations and shows that price with the Lowest Price block, or under the price of every product when you turn it on here.'=>'在歐盟，折扣必須顯示折扣前 30 天內的最低價格（Omnibus 指令）。Envo Blocks 會儲存您的產品和變體的價格變化，並通過最低價格區塊顯示該價格；如果您在此處開啟，則會顯示在每個產品價格下方。','Number of days'=>'天數','Show under the price'=>'在價格下方顯示','No – only where I add the Lowest Price block'=>'否——僅在我新增最低價格區塊的位置','On the product page and in product lists'=>'在產品頁面和產品清單中','Works with block and classic themes. Do not add the Lowest Price block to the same place too.'=>'適用於區塊主題和經典主題。不要在同一位置再新增最低價格區塊。','{days} is the number of days, {price} the lowest price. Leave empty for the default text.'=>'{days} 為天數，{price} 為最低價格。留空則使用預設文字。','Price history'=>'價格歷史','A change is saved whenever a product is saved (editing, bulk edit, import, scheduled sales); a daily check catches the rest. Until the history reaches back far enough, a discount shows the regular price as the lowest price.'=>'每次儲存產品時都會紀錄變化（編輯、批量編輯、匯入、定時促銷）；每日檢查會補全其餘部分。在歷史紀錄足夠長之前，折扣會把常規價格顯示為最低價格。','Products and variations with a history'=>'有歷史紀錄的產品和變體','History since'=>'歷史紀錄起始','Not started yet – the first check runs within minutes.'=>'尚未開始——首次檢查將在幾分鐘內運行。','Add the Lowest Price block to the product template, or see the %s.'=>'將最低價格區塊新增到產品範本，或查看%s。','guide'=>'指南','Part of Envo Blocks PRO.'=>'屬於 Envo Blocks PRO。','Review requests and rewards'=>'評價請求和獎励','Get more reviews – and more photos – without asking by hand.'=>'無需手動邀請，就能獲得更多評價 – 和更多照片。','Some days after an order is completed the customer gets an e-mail with the bought products and "Write a review" buttons.'=>'訂單完成幾天後，顧客會收到一封郵件，附有所購商品和「寫評價」按鈕。','When you approve a review of a bought product, the customer gets a one-time coupon as a thank-you – if you like, only for reviews with a photo.'=>'當您批準已購商品的評價時，顧客會收到一張一次性優惠券作為感謝 – 如需，可僅限帶照片的評價。','Both are WooCommerce e-mails in the design of your store, with their own texts.'=>'兩者都是采用您商店設計的 WooCommerce 郵件，並有各自的文字。','Review request'=>'評價請求','Send'=>'發送','days after the order is completed'=>'天後（訂單完成後）','Review reward'=>'評價獎励','% coupon'=>'% 優惠券','Only reviews with a photo'=>'僅限帶照片的評價','Price alerts and price history chart'=>'降價提醒和價格歷史圖表','The price history kept for the lowest price can bring shoppers back.'=>'為最低價儲存的價格歷史可以把顧客帶回來。','Price Alert block: visitors leave their e-mail on a product and get one e-mail when its price drops.'=>'降價提醒區塊：訪客在商品上留下電子郵件，降價時收到一封郵件。','Price History Chart block: how the price of a product changed, from the same history.'=>'價格歷史圖表區塊：基於同一歷史，顯示商品價格的變化。','An overview of waiting alerts and the most watched products on this page.'=>'本頁概覽等待中的提醒和最受關注的商品。','Minimum price drop'=>'最低降幅','An alert goes out only when the price falls at least this much below the price at the sign-up.'=>'僅當價格比訂閱時的價格至少低這麼多時才會發送提醒。','Quote page'=>'詢價頁面','— Choose a page —'=>'— 選擇頁面 —','With Envo Blocks PRO the button can be "Request a quote": customers collect products in a quote list and send it from this page.'=>'使用 Envo Blocks PRO，按鈕可以是「詢價」：顧客把商品加入詢價清單，並從此頁面發送。','Request a quote and wholesale prices'=>'詢價和批發價','Sell to businesses and on demand: let customers ask for a price instead of buying.'=>'面向企業和訂製銷售：讓顧客詢價而不是直接購買。','A "Request a quote" button instead of Add to cart on catalog products, and a quote list.'=>'目錄商品用「詢價」按鈕代替「加入購物車」，並提供詢價清單。','Each request is an order with the status "Quote requested": set the prices and send the customer a link to pay.'=>'每個詢價都是狀態為「已詢價」的訂單：設定價格並向顧客發送付款連結。','E-mails for you and the customer, in WooCommerce › Settings › Emails.'=>'給您和顧客的郵件，在「WooCommerce › 設定 › 電子郵件」中。','Wholesale prices: own prices for approved business customers, a discount by category and a minimum order.'=>'批發價：為已批準的企業客戶設定專屬價格、按分類折扣和最低訂單。','Checkout in steps and checkout designs'=>'分步結帳和結帳設計','Make a long checkout feel short.'=>'讓冗長的結帳顯得簡短。','Checkout in steps: contact, shipping and payment one after another, with a progress bar.'=>'分步結帳：聯繫資訊、配送和付款依次進行，並帶進度條。','More checkout designs in Store Layouts – distraction-free, split, with trust badges or products to add – with your checkout fields inside.'=>'商店布局中有更多結帳設計 – 無幹擾、分欄、帶信任徽章或可新增的商品 – 並保留您設定的結帳欄位。','Checkout in steps'=>'分步結帳','Show the checkout in steps'=>'分步顯示結帳','Contact, shipping and payment one after another, with a progress bar. Turned on in the block settings of Envo Blocks PRO; the fields set here stay in the steps.'=>'聯繫資訊、配送和付款依次進行，並帶進度條。在 Envo Blocks PRO 的區塊設定中開啟；此處設定的欄位會保留在各步驟中。','Checkout steps settings'=>'結帳步驟設定','Activate license'=>'啟用授權','Envo Blocks PRO is installed. Activate your license key to use this block.'=>'Envo Blocks PRO 已安裝。請啟用授權金鑰以使用此區塊。','Renew license'=>'續訂授權','Your Envo Blocks PRO license has expired. Renew it to use this block.'=>'您的 Envo Blocks PRO 授權已過期。請續訂以使用此區塊。','Product feeds'=>'商品資料源','Hide from the product feed (Google Merchant Center, Meta catalog)'=>'從商品資料源中隱藏（Google Merchant Center、Meta 目錄）','Product Feed'=>'商品資料源','no price'=>'無價格','no image'=>'無圖片','hidden or with a password'=>'已隱藏或有密碼','prices hidden by the catalog mode'=>'價格被目錄模式隱藏','out of stock'=>'缺貨','marked "Hide from the product feed"'=>'已勾選「從商品資料源中隱藏」','The feed was built.'=>'資料源已生成。','Product feed'=>'商品資料源','Your products as one XML feed for Google Merchant Center (Google Shopping and the free product listings in Google) and for the Meta catalog (Facebook and Instagram shops). Add the feed URL there once; the feed updates itself every hour when products change.'=>'將您的商品生成一個 XML 資料源，用於 Google Merchant Center（Google 購物及 Google 免費商品展示）和 Meta 目錄（Facebook 和 Instagram 商店）。只需在那裡新增一次資料源 URL；商品變化時，資料源每小時自動更新。','Feed URL'=>'資料源 URL','%1$s products in the feed, built %2$s.'=>'資料源中有 %1$s 個商品，生成於 %2$s。','Left out: %s.'=>'未包含：%s。','Build the feed now'=>'立即生成資料源','Open the feed'=>'打開資料源','Products › Add products › Add products from a file › Enter a link to your file'=>'Products › Add products › Add products from a file › Enter a link to your file','Catalog › Data sources › Add items › Data feed › Scheduled feed'=>'Catalog › Data sources › Add items › Data feed › Scheduled feed','The feed is off. Turn it on below to get its URL.'=>'資料源已關閉。在下方開啟即可獲取 URL。','Make the product feed'=>'生成商品資料源','All categories'=>'所有分類','Empty = all products. A single product is left out with "Hide from the product feed" in Product data › Advanced.'=>'留空 = 所有商品。單個商品可在「商品資料 › 高級」中勾選「從商品資料源中隱藏」排除。','Every variation as its own product (recommended by Google)'=>'每個變體作為獨立商品（Google 推薦）','Also products that are out of stock (shown as out of stock)'=>'也包含缺貨商品（顯示為缺貨）','Brands of WooCommerce'=>'WooCommerce 品牌','Attribute: %s'=>'屬性：%s','Always the text below'=>'始終使用下方文字','The text is used when a product has no brand. Your own products: your shop name.'=>'商品沒有品牌時使用此文字。自有商品：您的商店名稱。','Attributes'=>'屬性','Google asks for the color and the size of clothing and shoes.'=>'Google 要求提供服裝和鞋類的顏色和尺碼。','product condition' . "\4" . 'Condition'=>'商品狀況','New'=>'新','Refurbished'=>'翻新','Used'=>'二手','Google product category'=>'Google 商品類別','Optional: the number or the path of the Google category of most of your products (e.g. 267 = Mobile Phones). Google finds it by itself when empty.'=>'可選：您大部分商品的 Google 類別編號或路徑（例如 267 = 手機）。留空時 Google 會自行判斷。','The feed also takes the GTIN, UPC, EAN or ISBN field of WooCommerce (Product data › Inventory) and the SKU as the MPN.'=>'資料源還會讀取 WooCommerce 的 GTIN、UPC、EAN 或 ISBN 欄位（商品資料 › 庫存），並將 SKU 用作 MPN。','Product questions'=>'商品問答','Questions (%d)'=>'問題（%d）','Search the questions'=>'搜尋問題','Search the questions…'=>'搜尋問題…','No question matches. Ask it below.'=>'沒有匹配的問題。請在下方提問。','Asked by %1$s on %2$s'=>'%1$s 於 %2$s 提問','a customer'=>'一位顧客','Answered by %s'=>'來自 %s 的回答','Show more questions'=>'顯示更多問題','No questions yet. Be the first to ask.'=>'還沒有問題。來提第一個問題吧。','Thank you! Your question was sent. The answer will show here – and in your e-mail if you asked for it.'=>'謝謝！您的問題已發送。回答將顯示在這裡 – 如果您選擇了，也會發送到您的電子郵件。','Please fill in your name, a valid e-mail and the question.'=>'請填寫姓名、有效的電子郵件和問題。','Too many questions. Please try again later.'=>'提問過多。請稍後再試。','Your question could not be sent. Please try again.'=>'無法發送您的問題。請重試。','Log in to ask a question'=>'登入後提問','Ask a question'=>'提問','Your question'=>'您的問題','E-mail'=>'電子郵件','You ask as %s.'=>'您將以 %s 的身份提問。','E-mail me the answer'=>'通過郵件把回答發給我','Your name shows with the answered question; your e-mail is only used to send you the answer.'=>'您的姓名會與已回答的問題一起顯示；電子郵件僅用於發送回答。','Send question'=>'發送問題','New question about %s'=>'關於 %s 的新問題','Answer it in Envo Blocks › Settings › Product Questions'=>'請在「Envo Blocks › 設定 › 商品問答」中回答','New product question'=>'新的商品問題','Waiting for an answer'=>'等待回答','Answered'=>'已回答','Hidden'=>'隱藏','The answer is published.'=>'回答已發布。','The answer is published and e-mailed to the customer.'=>'回答已發布並通過郵件發送給顧客。','The question is hidden.'=>'問題已隱藏。','The question is in the trash.'=>'問題已移至回收站。','Customers ask about a product on the product page; a question shows there once you answer it. Publishing an answer e-mails it to the customer when they asked for it.'=>'顧客在商品頁面就商品提問；您回答後問題會顯示在該頁面。發布的回答會通過郵件發送給提出要求的顧客。','No questions here.'=>'這裡沒有問題。','wants the answer by e-mail'=>'希望通過郵件收到回答','Answer'=>'回答','Your answer…'=>'您的回答…','Update answer'=>'更新回答','Publish answer'=>'發布回答','Delete'=>'刪除','Add a "Questions" tab to the product page'=>'在商品頁面新增「問答」標籤頁','A tab next to Description and Reviews, in every theme. Or place the Product Questions block yourself, e.g. in the product template.'=>'在所有主題中，於描述和評價旁新增標籤頁。或自行放置商品問答區塊，例如放在商品範本中。','Who can ask'=>'誰可以提問','Also visitors who are not signed in (with name and e-mail)'=>'未登入的訪客也可以（填寫姓名和電子郵件）','New questions'=>'新問題','E-mail me every new question'=>'每個新問題都發郵件給我','The question does not exist.'=>'問題不存在。','Your question about %s was answered'=>'您關於 %s 的問題已有回答','Hi %s,'=>'%s，您好：','thank you for your question about %s.'=>'感謝您關於 %s 的提問。','See the product and the other questions'=>'查看商品和其他問題','Your question was answered'=>'您的問題已有回答','Tabs of this product only, e.g. care instructions, ingredients or a warranty. They show after the Reviews tab of WooCommerce, or where the "The product\'s own tabs" tab of the Product Tabs block is. Shortcodes work in the text.'=>'僅此產品的分頁，例如保養說明、成分或保修。它們顯示在 WooCommerce 的評價分頁之後，或 Product Tabs 區塊中「產品自身的分頁」所在的位置。文字中可以使用短代碼。','Remove tab'=>'移除分頁','Video of %1$s (%2$d)'=>'%1$s 的影片（%2$d）','Videos'=>'影片','Videos in the product gallery: a YouTube, Vimeo or Dailymotion link, or a video file (mp4, webm) from the Media Library. The player loads only when the visitor clicks play. A video file also plays (muted) over the product image in product lists while the pointer is on it.'=>'產品圖庫中的影片：YouTube、Vimeo 或 Dailymotion 連結，或媒體庫中的影片檔案（mp4、webm）。僅當訪客點選播放時才載入播放器。在產品清單中，滑鼠指針停在產品圖片上時，影片檔案也會在圖片上（靜音）播放。','Add video'=>'新增影片','Video link or file'=>'影片連結或檔案','Choose file'=>'選擇檔案','Cover image'=>'封面圖片','Without an image the main product image is used.'=>'沒有圖片時使用產品主圖。','Place in the gallery'=>'在圖庫中的位置','First (before the main image)'=>'最前（主圖之前）','After the main image'=>'主圖之後','Last'=>'最後','Remove video'=>'移除影片','Choose a video file'=>'選擇影片檔案','Choose a cover image'=>'選擇封面圖片','Unknown template file.'=>'未知的範本檔案。','This design is loaded from our template library, which could not be reached from your server. Please try again later.'=>'此設計從我們的範本庫載入，但您的伺服器無法連接到範本庫。請稍後再試。','The downloaded design is damaged. Please try again.'=>'下載的設計已損壞。請重試。','The block was not found.'=>'未找到區塊。','An active PRO license is required to insert this block.'=>'需要有效的 PRO 授權才能插入此區塊。','The page is too large for a preview.'=>'頁面太大，無法預覽。','Template was not found.'=>'未找到範本。','An active PRO license is required to import this template.'=>'需要有效的 PRO 授權才能匯入此範本。','This page of the template was not found.'=>'未找到範本的此頁面。','Photos in reviews'=>'評價中的照片','Customers add photos to their product review. The photos are saved as small WebP files without the camera data, show under the review once you approve it and in the Customer Photos block.'=>'顧客可在商品評價中新增照片。照片儲存為不含相機資料的小型 WebP 檔案，經您批準後顯示在評價下方和「顧客照片」區塊中。','Customers can add photos to their review'=>'顧客可在評價中新增照片','Photos per review'=>'每條評價的照片數','Largest photo (MB)'=>'最大照片（MB）','JPG, PNG or WebP. The server allows up to %d MB.'=>'JPG、PNG 或 WebP。伺服器最多允許 %d MB。','Approve reviews in Products › Reviews'=>'在「商品 › 評價」中批準評價','Review settings of WooCommerce (ratings, verified owners)'=>'WooCommerce 評價設定（評分、已驗證購買者）','Add photos (optional)'=>'新增照片（可選）','Choose photos'=>'選擇照片','Up to %1$d photo, JPG, PNG or WebP, up to %2$d MB.'=>'最多 %1$d 張，JPG、PNG 或 WebP，每張不超過 %2$d MB。','Review photo – %s'=>'評價照片 – %s','Customer photo of %s'=>'%s 的顧客照片','Customer photo %d'=>'顧客照片 %d','Previous photo'=>'上一張照片','Next photo'=>'下一張照片','Only the first %d photos are added.'=>'只新增前 %d 張照片。','A photo is larger than %d MB and is left out.'=>'有一張照片超過 %d MB，已略過。','pick a template and your brand color, and we set up the pages, the front page and the colors of your store.'=>'選擇一個範本和您的品牌顏色，我們會為您設定商店的頁面、首頁和顏色。','Start the wizard'=>'啟動精靈','Remove %s from the cart'=>'從購物車中移除 %s','Decrease the quantity of %s'=>'減少 %s 的數量','Increase the quantity of %s'=>'增加 %s 的數量','Quantity of %s'=>'%s 的數量','%s was removed from the cart.'=>'已將 %s 從購物車中移除。','The cart could not be updated. Please try again.'=>'無法更新購物車。請重試。','Close the cart'=>'關閉購物車','Panel'=>'面板','Slides in from the right'=>'從右側滑入','Slides in from the left'=>'從左側滑入','Open after Add to cart'=>'加入購物車後打開','Cart icons and cart links open it'=>'購物車圖示和購物車連結可打開它','The WooCommerce Mini-Cart, the cart links of the theme and the Sticky Cart of Envo Blocks PRO open this panel. Not shown on the cart and the checkout.'=>'WooCommerce 的 Mini-Cart、主題的購物車連結和 Envo Blocks PRO 的 Sticky Cart 會打開此面板。在購物車和結帳頁面不顯示。','Colour: Black'=>'顏色：黑色','Tax'=>'稅務','Incl. %s'=>'含%s','Excl. %s'=>'不含%s','Tax Switcher'=>'含稅切換','Including tax'=>'含稅','Excluding tax'=>'不含稅','Prices with or without tax'=>'含稅或不含稅價格','Let visitors choose whether the prices of the store are shown with or without tax (VAT) – handy when you sell to businesses and to consumers. Put the Tax Switcher block into the header or above the products; the choice is remembered and every price follows: product lists, the product page, the mini cart, the cart and the checkout.'=>'讓訪客選擇商店價格以含稅還是不含稅（增值稅）顯示——同時面向企業和消費者銷售時很方便。將「含稅切換」區塊放在頁首或商品上方；系統會記住選擇，所有價格都會隨之變化：商品清單、商品頁面、迷你購物車、購物車和結帳。','Taxes in WooCommerce'=>'WooCommerce 中的稅費','On – WooCommerce calculates taxes.'=>'開啟 – WooCommerce 正在計算稅費。','Off – turn on "Enable tax rates and calculations" in WooCommerce › Settings › General.'=>'關閉 – 請在「WooCommerce › 設定 › 常規」中開啟「啟用稅率和計算」。','Tax rates'=>'稅率','%d tax rate'=>'%d 個稅率','No tax rates yet – add them in WooCommerce › Settings › Tax.'=>'尚無稅率 – 請在「WooCommerce › 設定 › 稅」中新增。','Tax settings'=>'稅費設定','Default for visitors'=>'訪客預設值','Shop: %1$s, cart and checkout: %2$s'=>'商店：%1$s，購物車和結帳：%2$s','Visitors who have not chosen yet see the prices as set in WooCommerce › Settings › Tax ("Display prices in the shop").'=>'尚未選擇的訪客會按照「WooCommerce › 設定 › 稅」（「在商店顯示價格」）中的設定看到價格。','Until taxes are on and at least one tax rate exists, the Tax Switcher block shows nothing in the store.'=>'在啟用稅費且至少有一個稅率之前，「含稅切換」區塊不會在商店中顯示任何內容。','Switching'=>'切換','Visitors can switch between prices with and without tax'=>'訪客可以在含稅和不含稅價格之間切換','Off: the Tax Switcher blocks show nothing and every visitor sees the prices as set in WooCommerce.'=>'關閉：「含稅切換」區塊不顯示任何內容，每位訪客都按 WooCommerce 的設定看到價格。','Cart and checkout'=>'購物車和結帳','As chosen by the visitor'=>'按訪客的選擇','As set in WooCommerce (only the shop prices switch)'=>'按 WooCommerce 的設定（僅商店價格切換）','Text after the prices'=>'價格後的文字','By the choice: "incl. VAT" or "ex. VAT"'=>'按選擇：「含增值稅」或「不含增值稅」','The price display suffix of WooCommerce'=>'WooCommerce 的價格後綴','No text'=>'無文字','A fixed suffix of WooCommerce like "incl. VAT" would be wrong after a switch, so by default it is replaced with the text of the chosen mode.'=>'像「含增值稅」這樣的 WooCommerce 固定後綴在切換後會不正確，因此預設會替換為所選顯示方式的文字。','Text with tax'=>'含稅文字','Text without tax'=>'不含稅文字','Good to know'=>'須知','Add the switch with the Tax Switcher block (Envo Blocks section of the inserter), e.g. in the header template part; in classic themes and widgets use the shortcode [envo_tax_switcher].'=>'使用「含稅切換」區塊（插入器的 Envo Blocks 部分）新增切換，例如放在頁首範本組件中；在經典主題和小工具中使用短代碼 [envo_tax_switcher]。','The choice is kept in a cookie (envo_tax_display) for a year. The amounts charged never change – only how the prices are shown.'=>'選擇會在 Cookie（envo_tax_display）中儲存一年。收取的金額永遠不變——改變的只是價格的顯示方式。','Orders, e-mails and the admin always use the settings of WooCommerce.'=>'訂單、電子郵件和後台始終使用 WooCommerce 的設定。','Page cache: WP Super Cache, WP Rocket and LiteSpeed Cache keep a copy per choice by themselves. With another cache plugin or a CDN, add the cookie envo_tax_display to its "do not cache" or "vary by cookie" list; otherwise the block reloads a page that came from the cache with the other prices once.'=>'頁面快取：WP Super Cache、WP Rocket 和 LiteSpeed Cache 會自動為每種選擇保留一份副本。使用其他快取外掛或 CDN 時，請將 Cookie envo_tax_display 新增到其「不快取」或「按 Cookie 區分」清單中；否則區塊會將來自快取、顯示另一種價格的頁面重新載入一次。','Add to cart'=>'加入購物車','Remove %s from the wishlist'=>'從願望清單中移除 %s','Wishlist page'=>'願望清單頁面','Page with the %s block. A published page with the block becomes the wishlist page when none is set.'=>'包含 %s 區塊的頁面。未設定願望清單頁面時，包含此區塊的已發布頁面將成為願望清單頁面。','Wishlist Page'=>'願望清單頁面','Add %s to the wishlist'=>'將 %s 加入願望清單','Added to your wishlist'=>'已加入您的願望清單','Removed from your wishlist'=>'已從您的願望清單中移除','Added to the cart'=>'已加入購物車','In the cart'=>'已在購物車中','%d product'=>'%d 個產品','Invoices'=>'發票','— not mapped —'=>'— 未映射 —','The preset filled in the labels, identifiers and texts. Check them and fill in your identifiers.'=>'預設已填寫標籤、標識和文字。請檢查並填寫您的標識。','The fields were added to Envo Blocks > Checkout Fields (contact part of the checkout) and mapped to the invoice.'=>'這些欄位已新增到 Envo Blocks > Checkout Fields（結帳的聯繫部分）並映射到發票。','The PDF library is not installed in this copy of the plugin. Invoices are stored and shown as HTML for shop managers only.'=>'此外掛副本中未安裝 PDF 庫。發票會被儲存，並僅以 HTML 形式向商店管理員顯示。','PDF invoices'=>'PDF 發票','Invoices, credit notes and packing slips for WooCommerce orders. An issued document keeps its data even when the order or these settings change later. The country presets only fill in labels and texts; check them with your accountant – the plugin does not guarantee that they meet local law.'=>'WooCommerce 訂單的發票、折讓單和裝箱單。已開具的文件會保留其資料，即使訂單或這些設定之後發生變化。國家/地區預設僅填寫標籤和文字；請與您的會計核對 – 外掛不保證它們符合當地法律。','Issue invoices'=>'開具發票','Country preset'=>'國家/地區預設','Apply preset'=>'應用預設','Fills in the document labels, the identifier names, the tax texts, the paper and the date format. Your name, address, numbers and e-mails stay.'=>'填寫文件標籤、標識名稱、稅務文字、紙張和日期格式。您的名稱、地址、編號和電子郵件保持不變。','Issue at'=>'開具時機','The invoice is issued when the order gets one of these statuses. You can also issue it by hand in the order.'=>'當訂單進入以下任一狀態時開具發票。您也可以在訂單中手動開具。','Also for orders with a zero total'=>'也適用於總額為零的訂單','Attach to e-mails'=>'附加到郵件','Credit notes to the "Refunded order" e-mail'=>'將折讓單附加到「已退款訂單」郵件','Guests'=>'訪客','Guests can open their invoice with the link of their order (order key)'=>'訪客可以通過其訂單連結（訂單金鑰）打開發票','Seller'=>'賣方','Identifiers'=>'標識','Name, e.g. VAT ID'=>'名稱，例如 增值稅號','Value'=>'值','Company and tax numbers, as many as your country needs. Empty values are not printed.'=>'公司和稅號，按您所在國家/地區的需要填寫。空值不會列印。','Registered for VAT / GST / sales tax (prints the tax columns and the tax recap)'=>'已登記增值稅 / GST / 銷售稅（列印稅務列和稅務匯總）','Bank account'=>'銀行帳戶','Printed on unpaid invoices. Orders paid by bank transfer also get the payment QR code (Envo Blocks > Payment QR Code).'=>'列印在未付款的發票上。通過銀行轉帳付款的訂單還會獲得付款QR 碼（Envo Blocks > Payment QR Code）。','E.g. the company register entry, directors, contact.'=>'例如公司註冊資訊、董事、聯繫方式。','Choose logo'=>'選擇標誌','Buyer and products'=>'買方和產品','Buyer identifiers'=>'買方標識','Name on the invoice'=>'發票上的名稱','Which checkout field holds the company or tax number of the customer. Printed only when the customer filled it in; with a tax number and no tax, EU orders get the reverse charge text.'=>'哪個結帳欄位包含顧客的公司編號或稅號。僅在顧客填寫時列印；有稅號但無稅的歐盟訂單會顯示反向徵稅文字。','Add these fields to the checkout'=>'將這些欄位新增到結帳','Product fields'=>'產品欄位','Own fields of products and variations (e.g. HSN/SAC code, country of origin), edited under the SKU of the product and printed as columns.'=>'產品和變體的自定義欄位（例如 HSN/SAC 代碼、原產國），在產品的 SKU 下方編輯並作為列列印。','Numbers and dates'=>'編號和日期','Credit notes'=>'折讓單','New series every year'=>'每年新系列','New series every month'=>'每月新系列','One series'=>'單一系列','Start at'=>'起始編號','Placeholders: {number}, {number:5} (with zeros), {year}, {year_short}, {fiscal_year}, {month}, {order_number}. A number is never used twice. "Start at" moves the series forward, e.g. when you come from another system.'=>'預留位置：{number}、{number:5}（補零）、{year}、{year_short}、{fiscal_year}、{month}、{order_number}。編號永不重複使用。「起始編號」會讓系列向前推進，例如從其他系統遷移時。','Year starts in'=>'年度起始月份','For the yearly series, e.g. April for a fiscal year.'=>'用於年度系列，例如財政年度從四月開始。','Date format'=>'日期格式','Date of supply'=>'供貨日期','Date of issue'=>'開具日期','Order date'=>'訂單日期','Payment date'=>'付款日期','Due in (days)'=>'到期（天）','Unpaid invoices only.'=>'僅未付款的發票。','Payment reference'=>'付款參考號','Order number'=>'訂單號','Digits of the invoice number'=>'發票號的數字','Content and look'=>'內容和外觀','SKU'=>'SKU','Unit price'=>'單價','Discount'=>'折扣','Tax rate'=>'稅率','Tax recap'=>'稅務匯總','Taxes as WooCommerce counted them'=>'按 WooCommerce 計算的稅費','Tax counted once per rate and document (Japan)'=>'按稅率和文件計算一次稅費（日本）','Round down'=>'向下取整','Round'=>'四捨五入','Round up'=>'向上取整','With "once per rate" a difference to the order is shown as a rounding line; the total stays the one of the order.'=>'使用「按稅率計算一次」時，與訂單的差額顯示為捨入行；總額保持為訂單的總額。','Amounts'=>'金額','Total in words (English)'=>'大寫總額（英文）','India'=>'印度','QR payment'=>'QR 碼付款','QR code on unpaid bank transfer invoices (CZK, EUR)'=>'未付款銀行轉帳發票上的QR 碼（CZK、EUR）','The code of Envo Blocks > Payment QR Code (its format, account and message). Only an invoice issued before the payment can carry it: to send bank transfer customers the invoice with the code, check "On hold" under "Issue at" and attach the invoice to the "Order on-hold" e-mail.'=>'Envo Blocks > Payment QR Code 的QR 碼（其格式、帳戶和附言）。只有在付款前開具的發票才能帶有它：要向銀行轉帳顧客發送帶QR 碼的發票，請在「開具時機」下勾選「保留」，並將發票附加到「訂單保留」郵件。','Payment QR Code settings'=>'Payment QR Code 設定','Payment terms'=>'付款條款','Printed on every document, e.g. "Thank you for your order".'=>'列印在每份文件上，例如「感謝您的訂購」。','Text when not registered for tax'=>'未登記稅務時的文字','Reverse charge text'=>'反向徵稅文字','Reduced rate note'=>'優惠稅率說明','When set, items with a lower tax rate get "※" and this note is printed (Japan).'=>'設定後，稅率較低的項目會標記「※」並列印此說明（日本）。','Paper and direction'=>'紙張和方向','Text direction of the site language'=>'網站語言的文字方向','Left to right'=>'從左到右','Right to left'=>'從右到左','Labels of the documents'=>'文件的標籤','The words printed on the documents, in %s (from the preset). Change any of them, e.g. into your own language.'=>'列印在文件上的文字，使用%s（來自預設）。您可以更改其中任何一項，例如改為您自己的語言。','Show the labels'=>'顯示標籤','Preview (saved settings)'=>'預覽（已儲存的設定）','The preview shows the saved settings: save your changes first.'=>'預覽顯示已儲存的設定：請先儲存您的更改。','Label, e.g. HSN/SAC'=>'標籤，例如 HSN/SAC','Column on the invoice'=>'發票上的列','Fonts'=>'字型','Latin (also Turkish, Vietnamese and all European languages), Greek and Cyrillic are included. Other scripts need a font pack; an invoice with characters of such a script (e.g. a customer name in Japanese) shows a notice in the order. A pack is downloaded from assets.envoblocks.com only once, when you click Download, and every file is checked against its checksum. The fonts are then stored on your site and every PDF uses them from your own server; assets.envoblocks.com is not contacted again.'=>'已包含拉丁文（包括土耳其語、越南語和所有歐洲語言）、希臘文和西裡爾文。其他文字需要字型包；含有此類文字字符的發票（例如日文的顧客名稱）會在訂單中顯示提示。字型包僅在您點選「下載」時從 assets.envoblocks.com 下載一次，每個檔案都會根據其校驗和進行檢查。之後字型存儲在您的網站上，每個 PDF 都從您自己的伺服器使用它們；不會再聯繫 assets.envoblocks.com。','The font pack is installed. Make the PDF of existing invoices again in the order if they need it.'=>'字型包已安裝。如有需要，請在訂單中重新生成現有發票的 PDF。','The font pack was removed.'=>'字型包已移除。','Font pack'=>'字型包','Installed'=>'已安裝','No connection to assets.envoblocks.com? Upload the zip of a pack:'=>'無法連接 assets.envoblocks.com？請上傳字型包的 zip：','Upload'=>'上傳','Choose the zip file of the pack.'=>'選擇字型包的 zip 檔案。','The preview needs at least one order.'=>'預覽至少需要一個訂單。','HTML preview:'=>'HTML 預覽：','Invoice'=>'發票','Invoice %1$s'=>'發票 %1$s','Open PDF'=>'打開 PDF','Send to customer'=>'發送給顧客','The invoice contains characters of a script without a font: install the font pack %s in Envo Blocks > Invoices and make the PDF again.'=>'發票包含沒有字型的文字字符：請在 Envo Blocks > 發票 中安裝字型包 %s 並重新生成 PDF。','Credit note %s'=>'折讓單 %s','Make the PDF again'=>'重新生成 PDF','Cancel and reissue'=>'作廢並重新開具','Issue a credit note for the whole invoice and a new invoice with the current order data?'=>'為整張發票開具折讓單，並使用當前訂單資料開具新發票？','Credit note for the whole invoice'=>'整張發票的折讓單','Issue a credit note for the whole invoice?'=>'為整張發票開具折讓單？','No invoice yet.'=>'還沒有發票。','Issue invoice'=>'開具發票','Packing slip'=>'裝箱單','The order does not exist.'=>'訂單不存在。','Cancelled and reissued'=>'已作廢並重新開具','Invoice cancelled'=>'發票已作廢','Invoice sent to %s.'=>'發票已發送至 %s。','Same as the product'=>'與產品相同','Billing company'=>'帳單公司','Billing phone'=>'帳單電話','Billing state / region'=>'帳單省/州 / 地區','Checkout field: %s'=>'結帳欄位：%s','Japanese'=>'日文','Chinese (Simplified)'=>'中文（簡體）','Chinese (Traditional)'=>'中文（繁體）','Korean'=>'韓文','Indian scripts'=>'印度文字','Arabic'=>'阿拉伯文','Hebrew'=>'希伯來文','Thai'=>'泰文','Unknown font pack.'=>'未知的字型包。','The PHP zip extension is missing on this server.'=>'此伺服器缺少 PHP zip 擴充。','The file is not a zip archive.'=>'該檔案不是 zip 壓縮包。','The font pack is not the right one: %s is missing or changed.'=>'字型包不正確：%s 缺失或已更改。','The font files could not be saved in the uploads folder.'=>'無法將字型檔案儲存到 uploads 檔案夾。','The PDF library is missing.'=>'缺少 PDF 庫。','International (English)'=>'國際（英文）','European Union (English)'=>'歐盟（英文）','Czech Republic'=>'捷克','Slovakia'=>'斯洛伐克','Germany'=>'德國','Germany: businesses must be able to receive B2B e-invoices (XRechnung / ZUGFeRD) and must send them in the coming years. A PDF is not an e-invoice.'=>'德國：企業必須能夠接收 B2B 電子發票（XRechnung / ZUGFeRD），並須在未來幾年內開始發送。PDF 不是電子發票。','Austria'=>'奧地利','Poland'=>'波蘭','Poland: from 2026 B2B invoices are issued through the national system KSeF. A PDF from this plugin is then only an order document.'=>'波蘭：自 2026 年起，B2B 發票通過國家系統 KSeF 開具。屆時此外掛生成的 PDF 僅為訂單文件。','France'=>'法國','France: B2B e-invoicing becomes mandatory from 2026. A PDF is not an e-invoice.'=>'法國：自 2026 年起 B2B 電子發票成為强制要求。PDF 不是電子發票。','United Kingdom'=>'英國','United States'=>'美國','Canada'=>'加拿大','Australia'=>'澳大利亞','Turkey'=>'土耳其','Turkey: businesses registered for e-Fatura or e-Arşiv must issue the legal invoice through the GİB system or an integrator. A PDF from this plugin is then only an order document.'=>'土耳其：已登記 e-Fatura 或 e-Arşiv 的企業必須通過 GİB 系統或集成商開具合法發票。屆時此外掛生成的 PDF 僅為訂單文件。','India (GST)'=>'印度（GST）','India: businesses above the e-invoicing limit must report B2B invoices to the IRP and print the IRN and its QR code. A PDF from this plugin does not do that.'=>'印度：超過電子發票門檻的企業必須向 IRP 報送 B2B 發票，並列印 IRN 及其QR 碼。此外掛生成的 PDF 不具備此功能。','Japan (Qualified Invoice)'=>'日本（合格發票）','United Arab Emirates'=>'阿拉伯聯合酋長國','United Arab Emirates: e-invoicing is being introduced. Check whether your business must issue invoices through an accredited provider.'=>'阿拉伯聯合酋長國：正在推行電子發票。請確認您的企業是否必須通過認證服務商開具發票。','Saudi Arabia'=>'沙特阿拉伯','Saudi Arabia: VAT-registered businesses must issue e-invoices (FATOORA, ZATCA). A PDF from this plugin is then only an order document.'=>'沙特阿拉伯：已登記增值稅的企業必須開具電子發票（FATOORA，ZATCA）。屆時此外掛生成的 PDF 僅為訂單文件。','Brazil'=>'巴西','Brazil: the legal invoice is the NF-e / NFS-e of the tax authority. A PDF from this plugin is only an order document.'=>'巴西：合法發票是稅務機關的 NF-e / NFS-e。此外掛生成的 PDF 僅為訂單文件。','Order on-hold'=>'訂單保留','Processing order'=>'處理中訂單','Completed order'=>'已完成訂單','Order details (sent from the order screen)'=>'訂單詳情（從訂單頁面發送）','The invoice is being issued, try again in a moment.'=>'發票正在開具，請稍後重試。','Invoice %s issued.'=>'發票 %s 已開具。','The order has no invoice.'=>'該訂單沒有發票。','Credit note %s issued.'=>'折讓單 %s 已開具。','You cannot open this document.'=>'您無法打開此文件。','The document does not exist (yet).'=>'該文件（尚）不存在。','The PDF could not be made. Please contact the shop.'=>'無法生成 PDF。請聯繫商店。','This template needs an active Envo Blocks PRO license.'=>'此範本需要有效的 Envo Blocks PRO 授權。','This theme is not installed.'=>'此主題未安裝。','Store page (site header and footer)'=>'商店頁面（網站頁首和頁尾）','Store page (site header only)'=>'商店頁面（僅網站頁首）','Store page (site footer only)'=>'商店頁面（僅網站頁尾）','Page content without a title, between the header and footer of the site.'=>'不含標題的頁面內容，位於網站頁首和頁尾之間。','Choose a template first.'=>'請先選擇範本。','Choose at least one page to import.'=>'請至少選擇一個要匯入的頁面。','%d page of the template goes to the trash (you can restore it there).'=>'範本的 %d 個頁面將移至回收桶（您可以在那裡恢復）。','You edited the page “%s” after the wizard – it goes to the trash too.'=>'您在精靈之後編輯了頁面「%s」 – 它也會移至回收桶。','The theme is switched back to %s.'=>'主題將切換回 %s。','The front page is set back as it was.'=>'首頁將恢復為原來的設定。','The site name goes back to “%s”.'=>'網站名稱將恢復為「%s」。','You renamed the site to “%s” after the wizard – that name is replaced too.'=>'您在精靈之後將網站重命名為「%s」 – 該名稱也會被替換。','The site logo goes back to the previous one.'=>'網站標誌將恢復為之前的標誌。','The site logo is removed (the site had none).'=>'網站標誌將被移除（網站原來沒有標誌）。','The header and footer of the theme are put back.'=>'主題的頁首和頁尾將被恢復。','You edited the template part “%s” in the Site Editor after the wizard – those edits are lost.'=>'您在精靈之後在網站編輯器中編輯了範本組件「%s」 – 這些編輯將丟失。','The brand colours of the template are removed.'=>'範本的品牌色將被移除。','Starting draft made by the store wizard – check and complete it for your store and the law of your country before you start selling, then delete this note.'=>'由商店精靈建立的初始草稿 – 開始銷售前，請根據您的商店和所在國家的法律檢查並補充，然後刪除此說明。','Seller: %1$s, %2$s, e-mail %3$s.'=>'賣家：%1$s，%2$s，電子郵件 %3$s。','[your address]'=>'[您的地址]','What data we collect'=>'我們收集哪些資料','When you order, we collect your name, billing and delivery address, e-mail, phone number and the details of your order. When you create an account, we also keep your login details and order history.'=>'您下單時，我們會收集您的姓名、帳單和收貨地址、電子郵件、電話號碼及訂單詳情。建立帳戶時，我們還會儲存您的登入資訊和訂單紀錄。','Why we use it'=>'我們為何使用這些資料','To process and deliver your order, to handle payments, returns and complaints, and to meet our legal and accounting obligations. We send newsletters only if you agree to them.'=>'用於處理和配送您的訂單，處理付款、退貨和投訴，並履行我們的法律和會計義務。僅在您同意時我們才會發送新聞郵件。','Who we share it with'=>'我們與誰共享資料','With the carrier that delivers your order, the payment provider and our accountant – only what they need. [List your carriers and services here.]'=>'與配送您訂單的承運商、付款服務商和我們的會計 – 僅共享他們需要的內容。[請在此列出您的承運商和服務。]','How long we keep it'=>'我們儲存多久','Order data as long as accounting law requires; account data until you delete your account.'=>'訂單資料按會計法規要求的期限儲存；帳戶資料儲存至您刪除帳戶為止。','Your rights'=>'您的權利','You can ask for a copy of your data, its correction or deletion, and object to its use – write to %s. You can also complain to your data protection authority.'=>'您可以要求獲取資料副本、更正或刪除資料，並反對資料的使用 – 請寫信至 %s。您也可以向資料保護機構投訴。','Cookies'=>'Cookie','The store uses cookies needed for the cart and login. [Add analytics or marketing cookies if you use them.]'=>'商店使用購物車和登入所需的 Cookie。[如果使用分析或行銷 Cookie，請在此補充。]','Orders'=>'訂單','The order is placed when you finish the checkout. You get a confirmation by e-mail; the contract is made when we confirm the order.'=>'完成結帳即表示下單。您會收到確認郵件；我們確認訂單後合同即成立。','Prices and payment'=>'價格和付款','Prices are shown including tax [check]. You can pay by the methods offered in the checkout; by bank transfer the goods are sent after the payment arrives.'=>'價格已含稅 [請檢查]。您可以使用結帳時提供的方式付款；選擇銀行轉帳時，我們會在收到款項後發貨。','The delivery methods, prices and times are shown in the checkout. [Add your usual delivery time.]'=>'配送方式、價格和時間會在結帳時顯示。[請補充您通常的配送時間。]','Returns'=>'退貨','You can withdraw from the contract within 14 days of receiving the goods without giving a reason. Send the goods back unused; we refund the payment within 14 days of receiving them.'=>'您可以在收到商品後 14 天內無理由撤銷合同。請將未使用的商品寄回；我們會在收到後 14 天內退款。','Complaints'=>'投訴','If the goods are faulty, write to %s with the order number and a description of the fault. We handle complaints within 30 days.'=>'如果商品有缺陷，請寫信至 %s，注明訂單號並描述缺陷。我們會在 30 天內處理投訴。','WooCommerce is not active.'=>'WooCommerce 未啟用。','Free delivery'=>'免運費','Sample product – Classic'=>'範例商品 – 經典款','Sample product – Bestseller'=>'範例商品 – 暢銷款','Sample product – Premium'=>'範例商品 – 高級款','Sample product – New'=>'範例商品 – 新品','Sample product – On sale'=>'範例商品 – 促銷','Sample product – Gift'=>'範例商品 – 禮品','This is a sample product made by the store wizard. Replace it with your own product, or delete all unedited samples with one click in Envo Blocks › Store in 5 minutes.'=>'這是商店精靈建立的範例商品。請替換為您自己的商品，或在 Envo Blocks › 5 分鐘開店中一鍵刪除所有未編輯的範例。','Store country'=>'商店所在國家','Price format'=>'價格格式','Bank account (IBAN)'=>'銀行帳戶（IBAN）','WooCommerce settings go back to how they were: %s.'=>'WooCommerce 設定將恢復為原來的狀態：%s。','You changed these WooCommerce settings after the wizard – your changes are replaced: %s.'=>'您在精靈之後更改了這些 WooCommerce 設定 – 您的更改將被替換：%s。','The pages the wizard made go to the trash: %s.'=>'精靈建立的頁面將移至回收桶：%s。','You edited these pages after the wizard – they go to the trash anyway (you can restore them there): %s.'=>'您在精靈之後編輯了這些頁面 – 它們仍會移至回收桶（您可以在那裡恢復）：%s。','Pages the wizard published become drafts again: %s.'=>'精靈發布的頁面將重新變為草稿：%s。','The delivery zone “%s” is deleted.'=>'配送區域「%s」將被刪除。','You changed the delivery zone “%s” after the wizard – it is deleted anyway.'=>'您在精靈之後更改了配送區域「%s」 – 它仍會被刪除。','%d unedited sample product goes to the trash.'=>'%d 個未編輯的範例商品將移至回收桶。','%d sample product you edited stays as your product.'=>'您編輯過的 %d 個範例商品將作為您的商品保留。','General – address, selling locations, currency'=>'常規 – 地址、銷售地區、貨幣','Products – shop page, measurements, stock'=>'商品 – 商店頁面、尺寸、庫存','Tax – prices with or without tax, rates'=>'稅費 – 含稅或不含稅價格、稅率','Shipping – zones, methods, classes'=>'配送 – 區域、方式、類別','Payments – payment methods'=>'付款 – 付款方式','Accounts & privacy – guest checkout, data'=>'帳戶和隱私 – 訪客結帳、資料','Emails – sender, order e-mails'=>'郵件 – 發件人、訂單郵件','Checkout fields'=>'結帳欄位','Reviews with photos'=>'帶照片的評價','Lowest price (EU Omnibus)'=>'最低價格（歐盟 Omnibus）','Product feed (Google, Meta)'=>'商品資料源（Google、Meta）','Abandoned carts'=>'棄置購物車','Back in stock alerts'=>'到貨提醒','Sales notifications'=>'銷售通知','You cannot switch themes.'=>'您無權切換主題。','Not happy with how your store looks?'=>'對商店的外觀不滿意？','Your template was made for the Envo Blocks Store theme – with %s the header, fonts and shop pages can look different. Switching keeps your pages and colours, and you can switch back any time.'=>'您的範本是為 Envo Blocks Store 主題製作的 – 使用 %s 時，頁首、字型和商店頁面可能看起來不同。切換會保留您的頁面和顏色，並且您可以隨時切換回來。','Try Envo Blocks Store'=>'試試 Envo Blocks Store','View my store'=>'查看我的商店','I am happy, hide this'=>'我很滿意，隱藏此提示']];
